riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commit/32342a373dc6123a7e963f47efcb5c04880c62b1","node_id":"C_kwDORwBYjdoAKDMyMzQyYTM3M2RjNjEyM2E3ZTk2M2Y0N2VmY2I1YzA0ODgwYzYyYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commit/0e271bf6e82df64054de81918392e8a3361065ad","sha":"0e271bf6e82df64054de81918392e8a3361065ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commits/0e271bf6e82df64054de81918392e8a3361065ad"}],"sha":"32342a373dc6123a7e963f47efcb5c04880c62b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commits/32342a373dc6123a7e963f47efcb5c04880c62b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commits/0e271bf6e82df64054de81918392e8a3361065ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T06:43:55Z","email":"vault@claude-skill-vault","name":"Claude Skill Vault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T06:43:55Z","email":"vault@claude-skill-vault","name":"Claude Skill Vault"},"message":"feat: add 50 new production-quality skills (v2.0.0)\n\nNew skills added across all categories:\n\nAI/ML:\n- ray-distributed-computing — Ray clusters, remote functions, data distributed\n- streaming-llm-responses — SSE streaming, token buffering, backpressure\n- embedding-pipeline — batch generation, caching, dimensionality reduction\n- diffusion-models — SDXL inference, LoRA, ControlNet, ComfyUI pipelines\n- knowledge-graph — Neo4j Cypher, NetworkX, entity extraction, RAG integration\n- multi-agent-orchestration — LangGraph StateGraph, agent handoffs, routing\n- ai-agent-memory — EpisodicMemory (Qdrant), EntityMemory, Mem0, LangGraph checkpointing\n- vector-db-production — HNSW tuning, INT8 quantization, recall@10, pgvector\n- llm-caching-strategies — Anthropic cache_control, semantic cache, Redis TTL\n- llm-fine-tuning-pipeline — QLoRA, SFTTrainer, DPO, vLLM serving\n- ml-feature-engineering — ColumnTransformer, SHAP selection, temporal features\n\nSecurity:\n- zero-knowledge-proofs — circom RangeProof, snarkjs groth16, ZKMerkleTree\n- oauth2-oidc-implementation — PKCE, token rotation, JWKS validation\n- container-security — distroless, Trivy, Pod Security Standards, NetworkPolicy\n- end-to-end-encryption — pynacl, Web Crypto API, Argon2id key derivation\n- prompt-injection-defense — injection detection, OutputValidator, canary tokens\n- webscraping-anti-detection — Playwright stealth, Bezier mouse, proxy rotation, 2captcha\n\nBackend/API:\n- api-gateway-design — Kong, AWS API Gateway, rate limiting, circuit breaker\n- saga-pattern — choreography, orchestration, compensating transactions\n- hexagonal-architecture — ports/adapters, dependency injection, use cases\n- clean-architecture — entities, use cases, interface adapters, framework layer\n- functional-python — functools, toolz, monads, immutable data pipelines\n- error-boundary-patterns — Result types, circuit breaker, retry with jitter\n- graphql-subscriptions — WebSocket subscriptions, PubSub, DataLoader\n- api-rate-limiting — fixed/sliding window, token bucket, Redis Lua scripts\n- openapi-first-development — OpenAPI 3.1, openapi-typescript, schemathesis\n- websocket-realtime — ws/uWS, heartbeat, reconnection, broadcast patterns\n\nCloud/DevOps:\n- service-mesh-istio — VirtualService, DestinationRule, mTLS, observability\n- serverless-patterns — Lambda cold start, Step Functions, EventBridge, Fargate\n- distributed-tracing — OpenTelemetry, Jaeger, trace propagation, sampling\n- platform-engineering — Backstage, Crossplane, Argo CD, DORA metrics\n- blue-green-deployments — Kubernetes selector switching, ALB weighted targets\n- nix-reproducible-builds — flake.nix, devShells, NixOS modules, binary cache\n- mobile-ci-cd — Fastlane match/gym/pilot, GitHub Actions iOS/Android\n- dns-infrastructure — Cloudflare/Route53 Terraform, DNSSEC, failover, CAA\n- cost-optimization-cloud — EC2 rightsizing, Spot, Savings Plans, K8s VPA\n\nData Engineering:\n- feature-store-engineering — Feast, offline/online serving, point-in-time joins\n- database-cdc-patterns — Debezium, outbox pattern, Kafka sink connectors\n- data-versioning-dvc — pipeline stages, experiment tracking, remote storage\n- data-lakehouse-architecture — Delta Lake merge, Iceberg snapshots, ZORDER\n- database-migration-strategies — Alembic, Flyway, expand-contract, shadow tables\n\nData/Analytics:\n- postgres-sharding — Citus distributed tables, pg_partman, ShardRouter\n- ab-testing-statistics — sample sizing, CUPED, sequential testing, SRM detection\n- database-migration-strategies — zero-downtime migrations, Prisma migrations\n\nFrontend:\n- typescript-advanced-patterns — branded types, conditional types, builder pattern\n- nextjs-performance — Image optimization, font variables, unstable_cache\n- realtime-collaboration — Yjs CRDTs, Hocuspocus, usePresence, IndexedDB offline\n- react-native-performance — FlashList, Reanimated worklets, InteractionManager\n\niOS/Mobile:\n- react-native-performance — New Architecture JSI/Fabric, bundle analysis\n- swiftui-data-flow — @State/@Binding/@Observable, EnvironmentObject, Observation\n\nInfrastructure:\n- webassembly-rust — wasm-bindgen, wasm-pack, SIMD, multi-threading\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7769e3302e77eb882bbec54e8e64d21ecb042545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/git/trees/7769e3302e77eb882bbec54e8e64d21ecb042545"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/git/commits/0e271bf6e82df64054de81918392e8a3361065ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commit/0e271bf6e82df64054de819183