ault"},"message":"feat(skill): add ada-wcag-compliance skill (ui-ux category)\n\nNew skill synthesized from 5 real GitHub accessibility repos cloned and\nreviewed in session:\n\nSources:\n  1. xrnavigation/web-a11y-plugin — 23 cite-backed APG/WCAG skill library\n  2. Heydon/inclusive-design-checklist — comprehensive inclusive design list\n  3. pa11y/pa11y — automated LGPL accessibility testing CLI\n  4. w3c/wai-wcag-quickref — W3C WCAG 2.1/2.2 reference\n  5. niklasvh/html2canvas — canvas/image accessibility patterns\n\nSkill covers:\n  - WCAG 2.2 AA 10-item quick trigger checklist (document, nav, images,\n    contrast, focus, interactive elements, forms, motion, semantic sections,\n    support files)\n  - Top 10 violations from WebAIM Million 2025 + pa11y data\n  - Tailwind-specific accessible HTML patterns\n  - CSS accessibility patterns (prefers-reduced-motion, forced-colors,\n    :focus-visible, skip-link, sr-only)\n  - robots.txt + llms.txt templates\n  - Accessibility statement page requirements\n  - Automated testing commands (axe-core CLI, pa11y)\n  - All sources cited\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84cdf56c4aa79440442596e106754d559835992f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/git/trees/84cdf56c4aa79440442596e106754d559835992f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/git/commits/1ec7deddb64ec24fa7ed13d345c9d2ebae2c5860","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commit/1ec7deddb64ec24fa7ed13d345c9d2ebae2c5860","node_id":"C_kwDORwBYjdoAKDFlYzdkZWRkYjY0ZWMyNGZhN2VkMTNkMzQ1YzlkMmViYWUyYzU4NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UltronCore/claude-skill-vault/commit/60d9fe5306966eceba3284b7389b09a46d744d5a","sha":"60d9fe5306966eceba3284b7389b09a46d744d5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UltronCore/claude-skill-va