e2b6dd9a8806fcb3ea8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:20:37Z","email":"rohitjai7558@gmail.com","name":"Riojaikumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:20:37Z","email":"rohitjai7558@gmail.com","name":"Riojaikumar"},"message":"fix(stats): report real PR/issue counts, and scope the language card honestly\n\nThe CI-generated card showed \"Pull Requests 0\" and \"Issues 0\" — worse than no\ncard at all. Cause: the workflow runs with secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN, which is\nrepo-scoped, and user.pullRequests / user.issues return 0 under it. Those\ncounts now come from the search API, which reports public activity correctly\nwith any token (2,038 PRs rather than 0). An optional GH_PAT secret with\nread:user would additionally include private activity.\n\nRepositories are now explicitly privacy:PUBLIC so the count matches what the\nprofile itself shows (10), instead of depending on what the token can see.\n\nThe language card is retitled \"LANGUAGES · PUBLIC REPOS\". It can only measure\npublic repositories, so leaving it labelled \"most used languages\" implied a\nskill profile it cannot actually measure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016jscZ3HMrPhNPhUzFbry2K","tree":{"sha":"e577cfc77ecbf7fe9042c1d64a1ad1e7fd3c5a4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Riojaikumar/Riojaikumar/git/trees/e577cfc77ecbf7fe9042c1d64a1ad1e7fd3c5a4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Riojaikumar/Riojaikumar/git/commits/b83e2331f22f8b1bd28be2b6dd9a8806fcb3ea8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146117720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht