sts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Riojaikumar","id":146117720,"login":"Riojaikumar","node_id":"U_kgDOCLWUWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Riojaikumar/Riojaikumar/commits/d928b17eddcc33ca43f57eee94cd478a59d8c8c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:13:02Z","email":"rohitjai7558@gmail.com","name":"Riojaikumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:13:02Z","email":"rohitjai7558@gmail.com","name":"Riojaikumar"},"message":"feat(profile): animated README with an accurate, current tech stack\n\nReplaces the badge wall with three self-hosted animated SVGs and a stack\nrebuilt from the platform documentation rather than memory.\n\nAnimations (all self-hosted SVG, no third-party runtime):\n- assets/hero.svg — animated aurora field, gradient-cycling name, four\n  cycling role lines, drifting orbs and twinkling stars. Role 1 and the\n  rule are visible in the base state, so it still reads correctly if a\n  renderer ignores animation.\n- assets/architecture.svg — the real request path (browser -> Cloudflare ->\n  ALB -> federated gateway -> subgraphs / data / workflows) with pulses\n  travelling the wires.\n- assets/divider.svg — section rule with a travelling highlight.\n- Contribution snake, generated daily by .github/workflows/snake.yml.\n\nStack corrections. The previous README advertised six technologies the\nplatform does not run: Istio and NATS are retired, Azure was decommissioned\nand deleted, and Kafka, ArangoDB and GCP were never deployed at all — GCP\nhas zero occurrences across the entire corpus. Those are removed and\nreplaced with what is actually in production: EKS with Karpenter, FluxCD\nGitOps, Neptune, Valkey, DuckLake, Temporal, OpenTofu, Kyverno, Trivy,\nmanaged Prometheus/Grafana, OpenTelemetry.\n\nDeliberately NOT claimed, because the documentation shows them as planned,\nprovisioned-but-unused, or explicitly rejected: Fargate, MemoryDB, Bedrock,\nInspector, Graviton, Webpack Module Federation, RabbitMQ and SQS. Exact\nengine versions are omitted rather than pinned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016jscZ3HMrPhNPhUzFbry2K","tree":{"sha":"80ae37a382e1e1f774ecd59507441728f23c5ee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Riojaikumar/Riojaikumar/git/trees/80ae37a382e1e1f774ecd59507441728f23c5ee0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Riojaikumar/Riojaikumar/git/commits/d928b17eddcc33ca43f57eee94cd478a59d8c8c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146117720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Riojaikumar","id":146117720,"login":"Riojaikumar","node_id":"U_kgDOCLWUWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riojaikumar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c