ng, test isolation, UI fixes, and cache invalidation\n\nBackend:\n- Add JWT refresh token support with verify_refresh_token and /auth/refresh endpoint\n- Prevent email enumeration in register conflict error\n- Add cascade delete (all, delete-orphan) on all User relationships\n- Enable PRAGMA foreign_keys=ON at startup\n- Fix migration shim to skip ALTER TABLE on fresh databases\n- Add duplicate name checks before creating exercises and profiles\n- Add per-user AI rate limiting (30 calls/hour, sliding window)\n- Fix AI assistant to filter workouts/macros by profile_id, not just user_id\n- Defend against prompt injection in food analysis (delimiters + truncation)\n\nFrontend:\n- Fix progress page: clear analytics caches on every workout, macro, step,\n  and body-metric create/delete so today''s records appear immediately\n- Redesign login page with split-panel layout and fitness SVG illustration\n\nTests:\n- Isolate each test in a fresh in-memory SQLite DB via module-level patching\n  of database engine and session maker; fitlog.db no longer touched during runs","tree":{"sha":"a513e8bbe1a715a03d8b4c1692de6ccd4bdb2ba4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/a513e8bbe1a715a03d8b4c1692de6ccd4bdb2ba4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/bc501977ab4ea3b7c558a1125d7dbcd358795d98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://ap