om/users/OfirHaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/ebf5d0aafb374b70c3a315031974444e9cc5d1d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T18:01:27Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T18:01:27Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"fix: remove all HTML marker injections causing code on Profile screen\n\nThe del-row-marker div injected via st.markdown inside st.container()\nwas rendering as visible raw HTML text. Root cause: Streamlit''s markdown\nparser wraps inline content in <p> tags; a <div> inside a <p> causes\npremature tag closure and the text leaks to the screen.\n\nFix:\n- Remove both del-row-marker st.markdown calls entirely\n- Remove the with st.container() wrappers they were inside\n- Fix indentation broken by the container removal\n- Use type=''primary'' on Yes-remove button for visual distinction\n- Keep del-row-marker CSS in THEME_CSS (harmless when no matching elements)","tree":{"sha":"64e316ea987e90f244b90172cb1ceb7151d72247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/64e316ea987e90f244b90172cb1ceb7151d72247"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/ebf5d0aafb374b70c3a315031974444e9cc5d1d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_