S-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/eeac285b0c0a216e0e6c0161eeb2ea0c906c32a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T17:43:08Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T17:43:08Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"feat: Profile section — red delete button, inline goals, fix raw HTML on screen\n\n- Remove raw </div> tag that was printing as literal text on screen\n  (was caused by split open/close st.markdown pattern in create form)\n- Create form now uses plain st.form() with no HTML wrapper div\n- Move Edit Goals inline next to Activate/Remove buttons per card\n  (active profile: Edit Goals | Remove; inactive: Activate | Edit Goals | Remove)\n- Goals form expands inline below the card it belongs to,\n  keyed per profile (goals_form_{pid}) — no longer a bottom expander\n- Close Goals toggle collapses the inline form without reloading\n- Remove button is red via CSS :has(.del-row-marker) selector scoped\n  to each card''s st.container() — targets last stColumn''s button only\n- Confirm \"Yes, remove\" button also red via same selector\n- edit_goals_pid cleared when delete is triggered to avoid UI conflict","tree":{"sha":"b4171bf19118638b4a317c07bcbb6ab032f81d82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/b4171bf19118638b4a317c07bcbb6ab032f81d82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/eeac285b0c0a216e0e6c0161eeb2ea0c906c32a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commit/eeac285b0c0a216e0e6c0161eeb2ea0c906c32a1","node_id":"C_kwDORwetUdoAKGVlYWMyODViMGMwYTIxNmUwZTZjMDE2MWVlYjJlYTBjOTA2YzMyYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commit/9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4","sha":"9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4"}],"sha":"eeac285b0c0a216e0e6c0161eeb2ea0c906c32a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/eeac285b0c0a216e0e6c0161eeb2ea0c906c32a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T13:28:37Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T13:28:37Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"feat: redesign Profile section with delete support + fix AI chat CORS\n\nProfile section (frontend/app.py):\n- Replaced emoji avatar with gradient initials badge\n- Profile cards show goal color-coded chip, stats row (weight/height/age/gender)\n- Two-step delete confirmation per card (avoids accidental removal)\n- Inline create-profile form with Discard button, replaces bare expander\n- Active profile shows ACTIVE chip + accent border; inactive shows Activate + Remove\n- Empty-state illustration when no profiles exist\n\nAI chat fix (frontend/_ai_fab.py):\n- fetch() -> par.fetch() so HTTP request uses parent window origin (localhost:8501)\n  instead of null-origin srcdoc iframe; fixes \"Connection error\" on every chat\n\nBackend bug fixes (app/routers/):\n- Removed await from session.delete() in 9 routers (synchronous in SQLAlchemy 2.x)\n- auth.py: moved all imports above function definitions\n- ai_assistant.py: consolidated imports; context cache capped at 500 entries with eviction\n- analytics.py: BMI profile lookup uses order_by(created_at desc).first() not profiles[0]\n- profile.py: datetime.utcnow() -> datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n\nTheme:\n- Full light theme: white bg, slate text, emerald accent, plotly_white charts\n- Dark overrides injected after base CSS via session_state.theme\n- Theme toggle button fixed top-right corner\n- .streamlit/config.toml added (base=light, primaryColor=#059669)","tree":{"sha":"d032db5c7358975ef7fca90a7022d47bc95f53bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/d032db5c7358975ef7fca90a7022d47bc95f53bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commit/9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4","node_id":"C_kwDORwetUdoAKDlkMTU2MmUzYzQ2ZmU3MDY1MTZkNmY5ZDNmNjU4OTU4ODliZmRhYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commit/323718d77d7d2564c1d6b37e9797556aecb3d85e","sha":"323718d77d7d2564c1d6b37e9797556aecb3d85e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/323718d77d7d2564c1d6b37e9797556aecb3d85e"}],"sha":"9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/9d1562e3c46fe706516d6f9d3f65895889bfdaa4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https: