f","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/f4e167fa3fad8558b8de41780c5864abcc2c17d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T14:23:22Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T14:23:22Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"feat: UI overhaul, wellness tracking, AI coach FAB, and analytics date-range fix\n\nUI & Frontend:\n- Dark luxury theme (Whoop × Strava aesthetic) with electric green accent\n- Floating AI coach FAB replacing inline dashboard card\n- Redesigned sidebar navigation with clean tab styling\n- Goal vs Actual charts converted to line charts with explicit x-axis range bounds\n- My Progress time range selector: 1w/2w/1m/3m/Custom options\n- Custom date range now correctly filters both start and end dates\n- Charts now set explicit Plotly x-axis range so switching periods is visually distinct\n- Increased step data fetch limit from 90 to 200 entries\n\nBackend fixes:\n- macros /list: add ORDER BY entry_date DESC so limit=500 returns most recent entries\n- workout_logs /list: add ORDER BY log_date DESC for consistent recent-first ordering\n- app/security.py: remove duplicate dead except blocks in verify_password()\n- app/database.py: guard SQLite-only PRAGMAs against PostgreSQL\n\nWellness routers (sleep, hydration, body_metrics, recovery, steps): full CRUD\n\nCleanup:\n- Remove app/repository.py (dead code)\n- Remove INTEGRATION_REPORT.md, SUBMISSION.md (deployment artefacts)\n- Remove railway.toml, render.yaml (deployment config cleaned up)\n- Simplify Dockerfiles","tree":{"sha":"43d86459a520d62ba5d341874516df6e92f669dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/43d86459a520d62ba5d341874516df6e92f669dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/f4e167fa3fad8558b8de41780c5864abcc2c17d7","verification":{"payl