s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T10:57:33Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T10:57:33Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"feat: major overhaul — wellness tracking, AI fixes, UX improvements, user goals\n\nBackend:\n- Add wellness routers: sleep, hydration, body metrics, recovery, steps\n- Add ProfileGoals model and GET/PUT /profile/{id}/goals endpoints\n- Switch Groq client to AsyncOpenAI (fixes food analysis + AI chat in async FastAPI)\n- Add Redis cache with in-memory fallback (app/cache.py)\n- Add centralized config (app/config.py), exceptions (app/exceptions.py), security (app/security.py)\n- Add Alembic async migrations with SQLite batch mode\n- Remove dead repository.py; delete INTEGRATION_REPORT.md and SUBMISSION.md\n\nFrontend:\n- Add AI floating action button (_ai_fab.py) with CORS fix (allow_origins=[\"*\"])\n- Add wellness pages: Sleep, Hydration, Body Metrics, Recovery, Steps\n- Add user goals editor in Profile tab with TDEE-derived auto targets\n- Dashboard: onboarding card for new users, macro targets from TDEE formula\n- My Progress: unified time-range selector across all chart panels\n- Exercises/Log Workout: auto-seed common exercises for new users; guard empty\n  exercise list in Log Workout tab to prevent st.selectbox crash\n- Add CLAUDE.md project guide","tree":{"sha":"9a6faa0505996273f865a2795cf80fcb424825b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/9a6faa0505996273f865a2795cf80fcb424825b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/14ff66166b415c0c80a96f15d86e5397865ea59d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c