ail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"🔧 FIX: Improved workout logging error messages and handling\n\n✅ CHANGES:\n\n1. Enhanced create_workout_log() function\n   - Now shows actual API error (status code + detail message)\n   - Distinguishes between API errors and connection errors\n   - Provides clear error messages instead of generic failure message\n\n2. Improved Log Workout form\n   - Better handling of notes field (check if exists before stripping)\n   - Added loading spinner for better UX\n   - Better error display (now shows detailed error from backend)\n   - Removed redundant error message (already shown by function)\n\n3. Better Debugging\n   - Error messages now include HTTP status code\n   - API error details are displayed to user\n   - Clearer connection vs API error distinction\n\n🎯 BENEFIT:\n- Users can now see WHY workout logging failed\n- Makes debugging much easier\n- Better user feedback and transparency","tree":{"sha":"72caa01efd9ceeb2365882a6faa7a8125cab786f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/72caa01efd9ceeb2365882a6faa7a8125cab786f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/89a8895860f21557886a4622c60f5c653660f5e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github