212ca6e3c38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T09:07:34Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T09:07:34Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"✨ Professional Material Design 3 Theme - Google-Style UX Overhaul\n\n🎨 DESIGN SYSTEM IMPROVEMENTS:\n\n1. ✅ MATERIAL DESIGN 3 COLOR PALETTE\n   - Primary: #6750a4 (Purple) - Modern brand color\n   - Secondary: #625b71 (Taupe) - Supporting color\n   - Tertiary: #7d5260 (Pink) - Accent color\n   - Semantic colors: Success (Emerald), Warning (Amber), Error (Red), Info (Blue)\n   - Professional gray scale for text and backgrounds\n\n2. ✅ PROFESSIONAL STYLING\n   - Rounded buttons with elevation (100px border radius)\n   - Smooth transitions and hover effects\n   - Material Design shadows (5 levels of elevation)\n   - Clean typography with proper hierarchy\n   - Modern input field styling with focus states\n\n3. ✅ ENHANCED UI COMPONENTS\n   - Tab styling: Underline indicators, proper spacing\n   - Cards and metrics: Borders, shadows, hover states\n   - Forms: Clean layout with proper spacing\n   - Alerts: Color-coded with consistent styling\n   - Scrollbars: Styled to match theme\n\n4. ✅ IMPROVED USER EXPERIENCE\n   - Professional login page with centered, clean layout\n   - Better header design with branding\n   - Smooth animations and transitions\n   - Proper focus states for accessibility\n   - Better visual hierarchy throughout\n\n5. ✅ MODERN ICONS AND LABELS\n   - Updated tab icons: 📊📚💪🥗🤖\n   - Professional header with brand logo and greeting\n   - Clear, descriptive labels\n   - Better visual signals for actions\n\n6. ✅ ACCESSIBILITY & POLISH\n   - High contrast text for readability\n   - Proper spacing and margins\n   - Smooth color transitions\n   - Better hover/active states\n   - Professional animations (fade-in, slide-in)\n\n🎯 RESULT:\n- Looks like a Google or high-end design tool\n- Professional, clean, modern aesthetic\n- Excellent user experience and visual feedback\n- Consistent design language throughout\n- Better accessibility and usability","tree":{"sha":"8980b7f3a1f1408fe1c48ee555ae737c02df958f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/8980b7f3a1f1408fe1c48ee555ae737c02df958f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/514da8e29b609c7439b65484f493e212ca6e3c38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commit/514da8e29b609c7439b65484f493e212ca6e3c38","node_id":"C_kwDORwetUdoAKDUxNGRhOGUyOWI2MDljNzQzOWI2NTQ4NGY0OTNlMjEyY2E2ZTNjMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commit/ce0e14ade07976aeb5f0149d46ee00615c01c6c9","sha":"ce0e14ade07976aeb5f0149d46ee00615c01c6c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/ce0e14ade07976aeb5f0149d46ee00615c01c6c9"}],"sha":"514da8e29b609c7439b65484f493e212ca6e3c38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/514da8e29b609c7439b65484f493e212ca6e3c38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/commits/ce0e14ade07976aeb5f0149d46ee00615c01c6c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T09:04:02Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T09:04:02Z","email":"ofir135001@gmail.com","name":"OfirHaf"},"message":"CRITICAL FIX: Remove online database + fix workout logging + fix login persistence\n\n🔧 FIXES APPLIED:\n\n1. ✅ REMOVED ONLINE EXERCISE DATABASE\n   - Removed fetch_exercise_database() function\n   - Removed get_exercise_suggestions() function\n   - Removed format_exercise_option() helper\n   - Simplified Exercise Library to only show custom exercises\n   - Simplified Log Workout to only use personal library (not external API)\n   - Removed all online database search/suggestions\n\n2. ✅ FIXED API CLIENT CACHING BUG\n   - Changed get_api_with_auth() to create new client EACH TIME\n   - Removed @st.cache_resource from get_persistent_client()\n   - Now client always includes current token from session_state\n   - Fixes 401 Unauthorized errors after login\n\n3. ✅ FIXED LOGIN PERSISTENCE BUG\n   - Token is now always fresh in API client\n   - Session state properly passed to authenticated requests\n   - Login page no longer appears after successful authentication\n   - Users stay logged in across page reruns\n\n4. ✅ SIMPLIFIED LOG WORKOUT WORKFLOW\n   - Step 1: Select exercise from YOUR library (dropdown, not search)\n   - Step 2: Select date (prominent date picker)\n   - Step 3: Log performance (sets, reps, weight, notes)\n   - Much simpler and more reliable\n   - No more online database complications\n\n⚡ RESULT:\n- Clean, simple, working training interface\n- Login works properly and persists\n- Workout logging works reliably\n- No external API dependencies","tree":{"sha":"d33927acf2d99954f84475dc54ed82ae2a7618ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/trees/d33927acf2d99954f84475dc54ed82ae2a7618ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EASS-HIT-PART-A-2026-CLASS-IX/FitLog/git/commits/ce0e14ade07976aeb5f0149d46ee00615c01c6c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209338818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OfirHaf","id":209338818,"login":"OfirHaf","node_id":"U_kgDODHpBwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OfirHaf/repo