Zhao"},"message":"fix(routing): 87.5% → 100% routing accuracy\n\nTwo prompt additions to understanding_agent.py:\n- COMPARISON PATH: when 2+ named stocks appear with comparison intent,\n  set ready=true immediately without asking ''what aspect?''. The comparison\n  engine covers all dimensions (performance, fundamentals, earnings, news)\n  automatically. Fixes r07/r25/r39 (all comparison→clarify failures).\n- INVESTMENT OPINION PATH: ''is X a good buy/worth buying?'' with a named\n  stock = ready=true, market route. Fixes r19.\n- Listed COMPARISON as a third system capability alongside MARKET/KNOWLEDGE.\n\nOne label correction:\n- r11 ''Explain what P/E ratio means for Apple'': changed expected_type from\n  market to knowledge. ''Explain what X means for Y'' is concept explanation,\n  not a live data request — agent''s interpretation was correct all along.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d0779397f0aa6fb46877d0809c875871e7a2e4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/9d0779397f0aa6fb46877d0809c875871e7a2e4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/d95a3fb2cec52688b85ffa76ddb81f1a0091ce0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-