https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/ba2df9876e53254cfc9f5680df9007773f28a89f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:52:50Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:52:50Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"feat: include clickable news links in market analysis responses\n\nmarket_agent.py: pass full news items (title, url, snippet) as dicts\ninstead of pre-formatted strings, preserving the URL through to the prompt.\n\nmarket_prompt.py:\n- build_market_prompt: signature changed from news_snippets: list[str] to\n  news_items: list[dict]; _fmt_news() formats each item with title, URL,\n  and snippet on separate lines so the model can reference them precisely\n- system prompt: NEWS LINKS rule instructs Claude to cite each referenced\n  news item as a markdown hyperlink [Headline](url) in the Analysis section;\n  explicitly forbids fabricating links not present in the data block\n\nResult: news citations in the Analysis section render as clickable Yahoo\nFinance links in the frontend (react-markdown already handles [text](url)).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c726553b88997205a49f309907d3866f1288c009","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/c726553b88997205a49f309907d3866f1288c009"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/ba2df9876e53254cfc9f5680df9007773f28a89f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/ba2df9876e53254cfc9f5680df9007773f28a89f","node_id":"C_kwDORwnhmdoAKGJhMmRmOTg3NmU1MzI1NGNmYzlmNTY4MGRmOTAwNzc3M2YyOGE4OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc","sha":"00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc"}],"sha":"ba2df9876e53254cfc9f5680df9007773f28a89f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/ba2df9876e53254cfc9f5680df9007773f28a89f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:45:54Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:45:54Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"fix: resolve implicit stock references from conversation history\n\nThe understanding agent was only extracting tickers mentioned explicitly in\nthe current message. Follow-up queries like \"compare the data with Apple\"\n(where TSLA was discussed in the previous turn) would only extract AAPL,\ndropping the context stock entirely.\n\nThree prompt changes to understanding_agent.py:\n1. CONTEXT RESOLUTION rule in system prompt: explicitly instructs the model\n   to scan history for implicit references (\"it\", \"that stock\", \"the data\",\n   \"compare it with X\") and include all resolved tickers in the ticker field\n2. ticker field description: now says to include tickers inferred from history,\n   not just tickers explicitly in the current message\n3. refined_question description: must be fully self-contained with all\n   pronouns resolved (e.g. \"Compare TSLA and AAPL\" not \"compare the data\")\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45e98382c3a9c59214c149e61d224b5e8f6f6e25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/45e98382c3a9c59214c149e61d224b5e8f6f6e25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc","node_id":"C_kwDORwnhmdoAKDAwMjA2YTRkMzQxODFhNjkzOTk5NTUwNzRiNjE3OGE5N2ZiNTc2ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90","sha":"52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90"}],"sha":"00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/00206a4d34181a69399955074b6178a97fb576dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:42:44Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:42:44Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"fix: render GFM markdown tables in answer sections\n\nAdd remark-gfm plugin to ReactMarkdown so pipe-delimited tables produced\nby Claude (e.g. comparison performance tables) are rendered as HTML tables\ninstead of raw pipe characters. Add matching table CSS to index.css:\nmonospace font, dark borders, muted first-column labels, uppercase headers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7000f09d85e9c4f4490b1640a29ce657374d766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/f7000f09d85e9c4f4490b1640a29ce657374d766"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90","node_id":"C_kwDORwnhmdoAKDUyZmYyOTAwNjJjZGVhZjg2NTRhYzkwNjM1NGQwZjkwMDYwYmRkOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/ee444d057f38a010bc6eb93e1213abd7e594ba28","sha":"ee444d057f38a010bc6eb93e1213abd7e594ba28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/ee444d057f38a010bc6eb93e1213abd7e594ba28"}],"sha":"52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/52ff290062cdeaf8654ac906354d0f90060bdd90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/ee444d057f38a010bc6eb93e1213abd7e594ba28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:34:41Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T16:34:41Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"feat: multi-stock comparison — parallel fetch, side-by-side analysis, comparison charts\n\nBackend:\n- prompts/comparison_prompt.py (new): COMPARISON_SYSTEM_PROMPT with 4-section format\n  (Performance Comparison / Fundamentals / Earnings Trend / Summary) and\n  build_comparison_prompt() that generates a side-by-side data block per stock\n- agents/comparison_agent.py (new): fetches all tickers in parallel via\n  asyncio.gather + asyncio.to_thread; returns (answer_text, chart_data) where\n  chart_data.type=\"comparison\" bundles per-stock OHLCV, earnings, and key metrics\n- agents/understanding_agent.py: _parse_tickers() splits comma/space-separated\n  ticker strings; len > 1 routes to handle_comparison_query instead of single\n  market agent; len == 1 continues existing single-stock path unchanged\n\nFrontend:\n- ChartPanel.jsx: detects chartData.type === \"comparison\" and switches mode\n  · Comparison mode — 3 tabs:\n    Performance: normalised % return line chart (all start at 0%, one LineSeries\n    per stock, colour-coded by PALETTE); y-axis formatted as % return\n    Metrics: responsive table — price, 1D/7D/30D change (green/red), market cap,\n    P/E, dividend yield, 52W high, from-high %; coloured headers per stock\n    Earnings: grouped SVG bar chart showing revenue per stock per quarter,\n    colour-coded by stock; handles missing data gracefully\n  · Single-stock mode unchanged (candlestick + volume / earnings)\n- AnswerCard.jsx: ''comparison'' query_type renders \"Comparison\" badge label\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cee472798464294e6b507daec454f28c87d4ed2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/cee472798464294e6b507daec454f28c87d4ed2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/ee444d057f38a010bc6eb93e1213abd7e594ba28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url"