"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/7d70f0bc9a4a58d13c0553a2f3e9ba3d62619a53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T15:51:53Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T15:51:53Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"feat: inline financial charts on market answers\n\nBackend:\n- fetcher.py: serialize OHLCV history into price_history_ohlcv list[dict] on StockData\n- market_agent.py: return (answer_text, chart_data) tuple; chart_data bundles ticker,\n  company_name, currency, price_history (OHLCV), and quarterly_earnings\n- understanding_agent.py: unpack tuple and pass chart_data through to response dict\n- routers/chat.py: add chart_data: dict | None field to ChatResponse\n\nFrontend:\n- ChartPanel.jsx (new): two-tab chart panel\n  · Price tab: candlestick + volume histogram via TradingView lightweight-charts;\n    green/red candles, volume bars colour-coded by direction, live resize via\n    ResizeObserver, mini stats bar (close, 1D %, high, low, volume)\n  · Earnings tab: pure-SVG grouped bar chart (Revenue vs Net Income, last 4 quarters);\n    no extra dependency, auto-scales to data range\n- AnswerCard.jsx: \"View Chart\" button on market answers (toggle, only shown when\n  chart_data present); chart panel renders below the button, above answer sections\n- ChatMessage.jsx: thread chartData prop through to AnswerCard\n- App.jsx: attach data.chart_data to assistant-answer message object\n- vite.config.js: lightweight-charts in its own manualChunks entry (163KB gzip: 52KB)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45f72b4489d483198b23ee5a4442f004faa48ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/45f72b4489d483198b23ee5a4442f004faa48ac0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/7d70f0bc9a4a58d13c0553a2f3e9ba3d62619a53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/7d70f0bc9a4a58d13c0553a2f3e9ba3d62619a53","node_id":"C_kwDORwnhmdoAKDdkNzBmMGJjOWE0YTU4ZDEzYzA1NTNhMmYzZTliYTNkNjI2MTlhNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"htt