API reference, backend logging format, and design decisions.\n\nCLAUDE.md added to .gitignore — kept as a local project brief only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6f72b0ced1c9ab2f96417e2f6b4da913a6fe748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/f6f72b0ced1c9ab2f96417e2f6b4da913a6fe748"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/61e89ea3986a713a27aafaf391e7fae85bb70c79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/61e89ea3986a713a27aafaf391e7fae85bb70c79","node_id":"C_kwDORwnhmdoAKDYxZTg5ZWEzOTg2YTcxM2EyN2FhZmFmMzkxZTdmYWU4NWJiNzBjNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841","sha":"ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841"}],"sha":"61e89ea3986a713a27aafaf391e7fae85bb70c79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/61e89ea3986a713a27aafaf391e7fae85bb70c79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T18:52:20Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T18:52:20Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"feat: React frontend — animated globe, chat interface, ticker tape\n\nLayout and state (App.jsx):\n- Landing page: full-viewport animated holographic earth, question chips, scrolling\n  ticker tape, input bar below globe; globe height = viewport - ticker - input bar\n- Chat page: compact globe (172px) with orb status, message thread, InputBar below\n- Framer Motion animates globe between two concrete pixel heights so the R3F Canvas\n  ResizeObserver always receives a valid numeric height; Canvas never unmounts\n  (unmounting destroys the WebGL context)\n- History compression: calls /api/summarize-history when len(history) > 12, keeps\n  last 6 turns verbatim\n\nComponents:\n- FinancialGlobe.jsx: loads hologram_planet_earth_animated.glb via useGLTF; auto-\n  scales to 3-unit bounding sphere; plays all embedded animations; floating question\n  chips at tuned XYZ positions; OrbitControls with auto-rotate\n- TickerTape.jsx: CSS animation scrolling tape, 12 symbols, monospace, navy theme\n- ChatMessage.jsx: user bubbles right-aligned, assistant left-aligned; dispatches to\n  AnswerCard for structured answer messages\n- AnswerCard.jsx: parses ##-section markdown into animated panels with staggered\n  section-enter delays (Key Facts / Analysis / Summary)\n- InputBar.jsx: auto-grow textarea, 16px font (prevents iOS Safari auto-zoom), send\n  button with glow state, candlestick loading indicator\n\nBuild config:\n- tailwind.config.js + postcss.config.js: Tailwind JIT pipeline (were missing,\n  caused all utility classes to be silently ignored)\n- vite.config.js: /api proxy to :8000; Three.js manualChunks splits the ~1MB\n  bundle into a separate chunk for better initial load performance\n\nDependencies: @react-three/fiber@8 + drei@9 (React 18 compatible), framer-motion,\nreact-markdown, three\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7163533b89537cd929c069eed0b83226964eb553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/7163533b89537cd929c069eed0b83226964eb553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841","node_id":"C_kwDORwnhmdoAKGNjZDM4NjU1NGZkOWRhZTg1M2MxMzU4ZGNmNzg2OGZjN2RjM2U4NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40","sha":"4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40"}],"sha":"ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/ccd386554fd9dae853c1358dcf7868fc7dc3e841"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T18:51:45Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T18:51:45Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"feat: agent orchestration layer with structured logging\n\nAgents:\n- understanding_agent.py: multi-turn query intake using Claude Sonnet with tool-use\n  structured output; clarifies until intent_clarity=high and asset_resolved; routes\n  to market or RAG agent; resolves company names to tickers via Haiku + yfinance\n- market_agent.py: async orchestrator — fetch → compute → news → Claude Sonnet;\n  enforces no-LLM-arithmetic principle (all numbers pre-computed by calculator.py)\n- rag_agent.py: RAG retrieval → confidence gate (rerank_score >= 0.35) → Claude\n  Sonnet; falls back to Tavily web search for topics outside the 50-article corpus\n\nFastAPI entry (main.py):\n- CORS configured for localhost:3000 and :5173\n- Suppresses all yfinance/pandas FutureWarning and DeprecationWarning noise\n- Configures structured logging: [ROUTE], [MARKET], [RAG] lines in each agent\n  so route decisions, rerank scores, retrieved sources, and news counts are\n  visible in the server console for evaluation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb3dcb148b9b305b33531de90b42bf4e92c7f5b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/eb3dcb148b9b305b33531de90b42bf4e92c7f5b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40","node_id":"C_kwDORwnhmdoAKDRlMGUyODE5OGM0ZWQ2ZjU4YTQzNzEzNTRjYTIyZjI5NGU0N2NkNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commit/269741e2681a00674a900ecf3afeb0aee1b8b33b","sha":"269741e2681a00674a900ecf3afeb0aee1b8b33b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/269741e2681a00674a900ecf3afeb0aee1b8b33b"}],"sha":"4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/4e0e28198c4ed6f58a4371354ca22f294e47cd40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alan-zhao9655","id":62757178,"login":"alan-zhao9655","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzU3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/commits/269741e2681a00674a900ecf3afeb0aee1b8b33b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T18:50:18Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T18:50:18Z","email":"haoran.zhao@mail.utoronto.ca","name":"Haoran Zhao"},"message":"feat: backend data pipeline — market, RAG, prompts, routers\n\nMarket pipeline:\n- fetcher.py: yfinance → StockData (t.info-first, quarterly earnings, curl_cffi TLS)\n- calculator.py: pure-Python metrics (day/7d/30d %, trend, 52w range, avg volume)\n- news.py: yfinance t.news → Yahoo Finance headlines, no extra API key\n- web_search.py: Tavily search_depth=advanced → WebResult list (knowledge fallback)\n- ticker_resolver.py: Haiku infers ticker from company name, yfinance validates\n\nRAG pipeline (parent-child chunking, FAISS + cross-encoder reranking):\n- 50 Wikipedia .md articles across 5 financial categories (committed)\n- embedder.py: BAAI/bge-m3 1024-dim, MPS-accelerated, lazy singleton\n- chunker.py: sections → parent (~400 tokens) + child (~100 token) chunks\n- indexer.py: FAISS IndexFlatIP builder + loader with model mismatch detection\n- reranker.py: BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 CrossEncoder, MPS, graceful fallback\n- retriever.py: embed → FAISS top-20 → rerank → parent lookup → top-5\n- config.py: RERANK_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.35, model names, chunk sizes\n\nPrompts:\n- market_prompt.py: 3-section structured format (Objective Data / Analysis / Summary)\n- rag_prompt.py: RAG + web search system prompts with source citation format\n\nRouters:\n- POST /api/chat + POST /api/summarize-history (stateless, client owns history)\n- POST /api/query (direct path, ticker required, always market)\n- classifier.py: LLM-based router (superseded by understanding agent, kept for reference)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f13e93ff88732636cec1d1d8a25014c69646fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/trees/0f13e93ff88732636cec1d1d8a25014c69646fa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alan-zhao9655/Financial-Asset-Q-A-System/git/commits/269741e2681a00674a900ecf3afeb0aee1b8b33b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62757178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alan-zhao9655/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https