ini models. Adds knowledge loading/parsing, tokenized retrieval scoring (RAG), adaptive instructions based on player stats, model/provider selection and caching, and robust response handling. GraphQL schema and resolvers updated to accept history, provider and model parameters; gameHint now caches hints per provider/model and validates selection. Persisted provider/model on GameHint and added a compound index for faster lookups. Frontend GameChatbot updated to send message history and fixed provider/model, improved UX (focus/escape handling, unread indicator, refined categories and error handling), and removed a now-unused HintGlowCanvas component. Also adds @langchain/groq to backend dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"d982c2a6245987b39ead52fadb092207efbb7008","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjeev-cs/Group3_COMP308_LabAssignment_4/git/trees/d982c2a6245987b39ead52fadb092207efbb7008"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sanjeev-cs/Group3_COMP308_LabAssignment_4/git/commits/22bc82d6e0ac2329fe6609e06dc8814f906ba19e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186970432?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanjeev-cs","id":186970432,"login":"sanjeev-cs","node_id":"U_kgDOCyTxQA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjeev-cs/subsc