{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/28b797e8d902d8f8cc4553f12e0d7c090d0d4b0e","node_id":"C_kwDORwvc8toAKDI4Yjc5N2U4ZDkwMmQ4ZjhjYzQ1NTNmMTJlMGQ3YzA5MGQwZDRiMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30","sha":"4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30"}],"sha":"28b797e8d902d8f8cc4553f12e0d7c090d0d4b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/28b797e8d902d8f8cc4553f12e0d7c090d0d4b0e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T19:17:34Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T19:17:34Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"message":"Enhance IRData merge functionality to automatically handle background-dependent segments by rebasing through single beam. Introduce convert_to_single_beam option for flexible merging and update related tests to validate new behavior.","tree":{"sha":"4a790184118a5081748ad571a5cd21d83165d121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/trees/4a790184118a5081748ad571a5cd21d83165d121"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/commits/4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30","node_id":"C_kwDORwvc8toAKDRlMjY0ZGEzM2Q0NWRiNWI5N2FkYWI0MTg2YzhiZmZhZjBhMzNkMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b","sha":"e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b"}],"sha":"4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/4e264da33d45db5b97adab4186c8bffaf0a33d30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T18:56:40Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T18:56:40Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"message":"Implement time origin management for IRData, LVData, and MSData\n\n- Added methods to manage time origin (`tos_start`) in LVData and MSData, including:\n  - `with_tos_start`: Re-anchor `tos` to a new origin.\n  - `set_tos_start`: Replace the origin without altering `tos`.\n  - `del_tos_start`: Remove the origin, keeping `tos` as a relative axis.\n  - `move_tos_start_by`: Adjust the origin by a specified amount.\n\n- Introduced a utility function `_to_timedelta` for converting various input types to pandas Timedelta.\n\n- Enhanced tests for `tos_start` functionality across IRData, LVData, and MSData, ensuring correct behavior during merging and reanchoring.\n\n- Updated existing tests to accommodate changes in data structure and ensure compatibility with new features.","tree":{"sha":"ef0e086d4e13555fe35ade040086869f382a44be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/trees/ef0e086d4e13555fe35ade040086869f382a44be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/commits/e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b","node_id":"C_kwDORwvc8toAKGUyYTA1YTkzYTJmNzUyNWY0MmZjMmU0ODczMDAzOGM5MDA1MWYzNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7","sha":"2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7"}],"sha":"e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/e2a05a93a2f7525f42fc2e48730038c90051f35b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T10:13:54Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T10:13:54Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"message":"Add support for constructing IRData from spectrochempy NDDataset and implement read_nddataset function","tree":{"sha":"5797392cd493981bcdf2cf106a469c9a91236c8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/trees/5797392cd493981bcdf2cf106a469c9a91236c8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/commits/2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7","node_id":"C_kwDORwvc8toAKDJmNjdmYjdiMWMzMGI5NTBiYzcwZWEzMDIxZGQyNDZlYWQzZWFkYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/b659fc143e55ca09dda5a2c64b1470f99a7296a9","sha":"b659fc143e55ca09dda5a2c64b1470f99a7296a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/b659fc143e55ca09dda5a2c64b1470f99a7296a9"}],"sha":"2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/2f67fb7b1c30b950bc70ea3021dd246ead3eada7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":