 to access relative pressure and quantity adsorbed directly from the new attribute.\n- Modify from_arrays and from_tristar_xls methods to accommodate the new structure.\n- Adjust tests to validate changes in data structure and ensure correct functionality.\n- Improve documentation for clarity on usage and expected data formats.","tree":{"sha":"1144453f92fff1f914253b1d396f46ead838c214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/trees/1144453f92fff1f914253b1d396f46ead838c214"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/commits/6e0a394b846331b804259e73209c1e59b943caf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/6e0a394b846331b804259e73209c1e59b943caf1","node_id":"C_kwDORwvc8toAKDZlMGEzOTRiODQ2MzMxYjgwNDI1OWU3MzIwOWMxZTU5Yjk0M2NhZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe","sha":"dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe"}],"sha":"6e0a394b846331b804259e73209c1e59b943caf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/6e0a394b846331b804259e73209c1e59b943caf1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:17:46Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:17:46Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"message":"Add parser for Micromeritics TriStar II 3020 multi-report XLS exports\n\n- Implemented a new parser in `phd_parser.physisorption.tristar.py` to handle the multi-report XLS exports from Micromeritics TriStar II 3020.\n- Added functions to parse various report sections, extract relevant data, and convert raw values into structured formats.\n- Created unit tests for the new parser, validating the extraction of isotherm data, BET results, and report structure.\n- Updated existing tests in the infrared and TGA modules to reflect changes in data handling.\n- Added a sample XLS file for testing purposes.\n- Updated dependencies to include `xlrd` for reading XLS files.","tree":{"sha":"f0a8bdf69b407ed03e71eb06b645759b350295db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/trees/f0a8bdf69b407ed03e71eb06b645759b350295db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/commits/dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe","node_id":"C_kwDORwvc8toAKGRjMjgwYmEyODY0MzE3Mjg5NGZlNWVjNGIwZTdjZDQ4OWQ3MTczZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commit/a7a62eb95febaa1c521c3584e5430a2124c46ba1","sha":"a7a62eb95febaa1c521c3584e5430a2124c46ba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/a7a62eb95febaa1c521c3584e5430a2124c46ba1"}],"sha":"dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/dc280ba28643172894fe5ec4b0e7cd489d7173fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/commits/a7a62eb95febaa1c521c3584e5430a2124c46ba1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T07:10:42Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T07:10:42Z","email":"julius@hof-sommer.org","name":"Julius Sommer"},"message":"Add methods to select wavenumber and scan ID ranges in IRData class","tree":{"sha":"b770b214cf8fee897b9ada1b65a95eb043345872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/js-chemE/PhD_parser/git/trees/b770b214cf8fee897b9ada1b65a95eb043345872"},"url"