999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/e3fee7814bfbbeb19e82d8342043c898c786c17c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:06:21Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:06:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(workflows/sdd): migrate sdd-session-compact.sh to canonical state.yaml schema (#73)\n\nPR #67 rewrote the OpenCode compaction plugin (plugins/sdd-compaction.ts)\nto the canonical schema but left hooks/sdd-session-compact.sh (the\nClaude Tier-1a SessionStart hook) on the old contract. It still:\n\n- parsed `current_phase:` / `next_step:` — field names that no longer\n  exist; the orchestrator writes `phase:` / `next:`, so every recovery\n  push said `current_phase: unknown / NEXT: check state.yaml`\n- re-injected the Role Invariant block and the `Load Skill(sdd-orchestrator)`\n  instruction (the jailbreak vector removed elsewhere)\n- carried the \"CRITICAL: ... you MUST run compaction recovery NOW\" preamble\n- did not skip terminal workflows (phase: done / next: done)\n\nThis brings it in lockstep with sdd-compaction.ts: parses `phase:` /\n`next:`, skips terminal workflows, drops the defensive prose, and adds\nthe \"no orientation sentence\" directive in the pushed context.\n(Fix originally landed in lib-purchaseai; back-ported here.)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb8d51a437205db958afd6f0890413db1e324308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/cb8d51a437205db958afd6f0890413db1e324308"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/e3fee7814bfbbeb19e82d8342043c898c786c17c","verification":{"payload":"tree cb8d51a437205db958afd6f0890413db1e324308\nparent ca91e05645c0bbc5cc727f700e691901b0af825d\nauthor David Arce <davidarce2915@gmail.com> 1778483181 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778483181 +0200\n\nfix(workflows/sdd): migrate sdd-session-compact.sh to canonical state.yaml schema (#73)\n\nPR #67 rewrote the OpenCode compaction plugin (plugins/sdd-compaction.ts)\nto the canonical schema but left hooks/sdd-session-compact.sh (the\nClaude Tier-1a SessionStart hook) on the old contract. It still:\n\n- parsed `current_phase:` / `next_step:` — field names that no longer\n  exist; the orchestrator writes `phase:` / `next:`, so every recovery\n  push said `current_phase: unknown / NEXT: check state.yaml`\n- re-injected the Role Invariant block and the `Load Skill(sdd-orchestrator)`\n  instruction (the jailbreak vector removed elsewhere)\n- carried the \"CRITICAL: ... you MUST run compaction recovery NOW\" preamble\n- did not skip terminal workflows (phase: done / next: done)\n\nThis brings it in lockstep with sdd-compaction.ts: parses `phase:` /\n`next:`, skips terminal workflows, drops the defensive prose, and adds\nthe \"no orientation sentence\" directive in the pushed context.\n(Fix originally landed in lib-purchaseai; back-ported here.)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAX/tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADXoQABXkLIxNrL494FW26n8mV6jx\nA//5suLgVdVwYpcKczV6m/AsmaubRSIXXtDGyQrhOpd1SaUeEqHekraga4zuYZQJ\nGhhtdzuq575c5zOqfIQ37yMA9tTwXndWTk+Rgij3c4xOFR9/H41P+qb/aKFS+wOn\nbSwdLDz+mNTNz6UjWptv3oSQJiCvZjGPD4Ttgd6zZcj/YeGQz4n