"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/2575db48e6cbfa22002c9ef80bc060595c6746ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:43:08Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:43:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tools): correct crit brew install command (#71)\n\nThe tap ''tomasz-tomczyk/tap/crit'' does not resolve. The official\nHomebrew formula is simply ''crit'' (available on Homebrew core).\n\nThis was causing ''brew install tomasz-tomczyk/tap/crit'' to fail with\nexit status 1 when consumers run DevRune''s Upgrade Tools menu.","tree":{"sha":"f86703bbb70a025cc0cb7db3f8ad7cb00e82f792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/f86703bbb70a025cc0cb7db3f8ad7cb00e82f792"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/2575db48e6cbfa22002c9ef80bc060595c6746ef","verification":{"payload":"tree f86703bbb70a025cc0cb7db3f8ad7cb00e82f792\nparent 63d2c48c474f11b6d946fd794d57030e21ad32eb\nauthor David Arce <davidarce2915@gmail.com> 1778481788 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778481788 +0200\n\nfix(tools): correct crit brew install command (#71)\n\nThe tap ''tomasz-tomczyk/tap/crit'' does not resolve. The official\nHomebrew formula is simply ''crit'' (available on Homebrew core).\n\nThis was causing ''brew install tomasz-tomczyk/tap/crit'' to fail with\nexit status 1 when consumers run DevRune''s Upgrade Tools menu.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAXp8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+zcQAB+6Bl/eaJ1Q9AZdhw/3n3WS\nC66UaSnoXagV3RtZI0+fCNa3IViJpTgVxMySl7vcE9+JkMlQG6rRDUxx56iaV5nJ\nWgF6DTK0YGbWvJq1WGdaHbbSRfV14uIW7nOtcYwQQjVhC7mh8XNpJA5LfVHYWnZX\nPxEyj7pxJVhoUWUjzMA6pGPjfgAmCP3QCzTJYW4J3um0YWCMTTl3+L6HZLzFBbOF\nUkyNSP3+I95EHxYOpurQcNXPAc8O9xMEYquqgFjBzawFNsVCG/voBxIkSX3FfZUZ\nQKmN8Fg91i487p