tps://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/b5acd905f4c884c33a31aebbc0f104705f5de413/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:16:35Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:16:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(workflows/sdd): drop placeholder patterns the renderer cannot resolve (#58)\n\nFound while inspecting the materialised opencode.json: the prompt still\ncontained literal {WORKFLOW_SUBAGENT_*} and {WORKFLOW_SUBAGENT_<PHASE>}.\nDevRune only resolves concrete keys (EXPLORER, PLANNER, IMPLEMENTER,\nREVIEWER, ADVISOR), so the wildcard / generic placeholder forms reached\nthe model as raw strings — useless and potentially confusing.\n\nReplaced with prose that points the orchestrator at\n{WORKFLOW_DIR}/_shared/launch-templates.md (where the concrete\nsubagent_type per phase already lives, fully resolved).","tree":{"sha":"e4de62f9220aa8154ac8debec4aafb06d0fbbb6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/e4de62f9220aa8154ac8debec4aafb06d0fbbb6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/b5acd905f4c884c33a31aebbc0f104705f5de413","verification":{"payload":"tree e4de62f9220aa8154ac8debec4aafb06d0fbbb6a\nparent d9d4a321438ef388e36a3e9a8927b858e4059b34\nauthor David Arce <davidarce2915@gmail.co