davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/23ade844b131f12de18459b763d51d002421c7c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:07:29Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:07:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(sdd): slim phase SKILL.md files (M3+M4+M6) (#36)\n\nEach phase SKILL.md (explore/plan/implement/review) carried two large\nduplicated sections — `## Engram Persistence` and `## General Knowledge\nPersistence` — plus three near-identical checklists (Success Criteria,\nGotchas, Anti-patterns) that rephrased the same constraints three ways.\nThe four files together totalled 1218 lines, with ~30% of that being\nrestatements already canonical in `_shared/persistence-contract.md`\nand `_shared/envelope-contract.md`.\n\nThis drains the agent''s context window on every phase invocation and\nmakes compaction more frequent — which was the second-order cause of\nthe post-compaction role-loss reported in #33.\n\nChanges per phase SKILL.md (uniformly):\n\n- M3 · Drop `## Engram Persistence` and `## General Knowledge\n  Persistence` sections; replace with a one-line cross-reference to\n  `_shared/persistence-contract.md` plus the per-phase\n  `title`/`topic_key` (e.g. `sdd/{change}/explore`).\n\n- M4 · Collapse `## Success Criteria` ✅ + `## Gotchas` + `## Anti-\n  patterns to Avoid` 🚫 into a single concise `## Self-Check` section\n  with the must-do''s specific to that phase. Drop boilerplate that\n  rephrases generic SDD rules (e.g. \"envelope is your last output\" —\n  already in envelope-contract.md).\n\n- M6 · Drop `<meta prompt 1 = \"System: ...\">` role preambles. The\n  orchestrator names the role via `subagent_type`; the in-file\n  re-naming was decoration. (No other catalog skills use this tag.)\n\nCounterpart in `_shared/persistence-contract.md`:\n\n- Add a `## Phase Artifact Save Convention` table with the per-phase\n  `title`/`topic_key` and content summary. The phase SKILL.md files\n  reference this table instead of inlining the same `mem_save(...)`\n  block four times.\n\nNet effect (catalog only):\n\n| File                         | before | after | Δ      |\n|------------------------------|--------|-------|--------|\n| sdd-explore/SKILL.md         |    277 |   127 | -150   |\n| sdd-plan/SKILL.md            |    365 |   200 | -165   |\n| sdd-implement/SKILL.md       |    316 |   131 | -185   |\n| sdd-review/SKILL.md          |    260 |   172 |  -88   |\n| _shared/persistence-contract |    232 |   257 |  +25   |\n| **total**                    |   1450 |   887 | **-563** |\n\nPhase-specific logic preserved in full: re-entry paths, Deep\nInterview methodology, Team Selection / Guidance Request flow, Detail\nQuality Gate, Batch Assignment Table format, per-batch Quality Gate,\nlarge-file write strategy, workspace-aware target resolution\n(sdd-review Step 0), Handoff Contract headings, etc. The strip\nremoves restatements, not signal.\n\nCloses M3 + M4 + M6 of #33.","tree":{"sha":"1fba8aca0bd33474285fdbc71352851cd409de5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/1fba8aca0bd33474285fdbc71352851cd409de5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/23ade844b131f12de18459b763d51d002421c7c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 1fba8aca0bd33474285fdbc71352851cd409de5c\nparent f867277964d0be44b388afa93f54bd91c986f9c5\nauthor David Arce <davidarce2915@gmail.com> 1777817249 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777817249 +0200\n\nrefactor(sdd): slim phase SKILL.md files (M3+M4+M6) (#36)\n\nEach phase SKILL.md (explore/plan/implement/review) carried two large\nduplicated sections — `## Engram Persistence` and `## General Knowledge\nPersistence` — plus three near-identical checklists (Success Criteria,\nGotchas, Anti-patterns) that rephrased the same constraints three ways.\nThe four files together totalled 1218 lines, with ~30% of that being\nrestatements already canonical in `_shared/persistence-contract.md`\nand `_shared/envelope-contract.md`.\n\nThis drains the agent''s context window on every phase invocation and\nmakes compaction more frequent — which was the second-order cause of\nthe post-compaction role-loss reported in #33.\n\nChanges per phase SKILL.md (uniformly):\n\n- M3 · Drop `## Engram Persistence` and `## General Knowledge\n  Persistence` sections; replace with a one-line cross-reference to\n  `_shared/persistence-contract.md` plus the per-phase\n  `title`/`topic_key` (e.g. `sdd/{change}/explore`).\n\n- M4 · Collapse `## Success Criteria` ✅ + `## Gotchas` + `## Anti-\n  patterns to Avoid` 🚫 into a single concise `## Self-Check` section\n  with the must-do''s specific to that phase. Drop boilerplate that\n  rephrases generic SDD rules (e.g. \"envelope is your last output\" —\n  already in envelope-contract.md).\n\n- M6 · Drop `<meta prompt 1 = \"System: ...\">` role preambles. The\n  orchestrator names the role via `subagent_type`; the in-file\n  re-naming was decoration. (No other catalog skills use this tag.)\n\nCounterpart in `_shared/persistence-contract.md`:\n\n- Add a `## Phase Artifact Save Convention` table with the per-phase\n  `title`/`topic_key` and content summary. The phase SKILL.md files\n  reference this table instead of inlining the same `mem_save(...)`\n  block four times.\n\nNet effect (catalog only):\n\n| File                         | before | after | Δ      |\n|------------------------------|--------|-------|--------|\n| sdd-explore/SKILL.md         |    277 |   127 | -150   |\n| sdd-plan/SKILL.md            |    365 |   200 | -165   |\n| sdd-implement/SKILL.md       |    316 |   131 | -185   |\n| sdd-review/SKILL.md          |    260 |   172 |  -88   |\n| _shared/persistence-contract |    232 |   257 |  +25   |\n| **total**                    |   1450 |   887 | **-563** |\n\nPhase-specific logic preserved in full: re-entry paths, Deep\nInterview methodology, Team Selection / Guidance Request flow, Detail\nQuality Gate, Batch Assignment Table format, per-batch Quality Gate,\nlarge-file write strategy, workspace-aware target resolution\n(sdd-review Step 0), Handoff Contract headings, etc. The strip\nremoves restatements, not signal.\n\nCloses M3 + M4 + M6 of #33.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp91ahCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQJEQAAtpP2vXnje8PLH8PhJAWASy\nlmBIukoqtu/qfeWPEdgozOWdtYuxwAkA7lu27Kg34QtW0m6+g4C71/Km9DTlGZYG\nG0qsTFIzvF/c0JCuU1+iKLwV0jfyi9kADfxJuBPHC5JgzQqCd0CsZp1cBkWn9kFj\nxaRZF2cPe1XpEpEisUboXGWa4A0hO0fSQJVd7iCa5alFBPNI6MNo+NkeB2WyNBd0\nxOIzeLChwbBT62k6Qnn0G5NTMelFpBWYEjW7sKB3d9MBT1/4e2Xm5NegUUJ9NmC8\ngyqoVT+ruUalYijnIRtavwfqlCSCnTdWV4dzgpWOUCCpZ7sssg6bb4NSMmUfFruR\n9bkPl/YT5p+dYKd/BmMzqmi0bEU7C+r2vll2ilSdREg78u+px3aIvPUa1liJYswT\nk79SXnddnOs3Nr8V1GNiuDFiZC+fykz91APzr1zX/hXFYa6wwUF6qckhbHAJYJAy\nE0yUY13nXris3S7UzlTta2zhnYuCIsCMupTcWua/2nRYC9DxBoe+Spy2sl2SHcF2\nvINi6ZK6kf3VpaDlkp5l/z9VP79ylICWZiLS3/F44AOFFBsbP8rONyaHTCEjJTNU\n7zncIwDv/goeVxbqdlZsqJGU51CcS9mlAet42T3pLvgazqUHXlj49/sHO47FcBUt\n/4O+lorXeU7H+Uk+m8Z4\n=cB1D