l":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/8d78c0fc3379ac462c52cbfe59eb009474bfdb75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T16:55:49Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T16:55:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: align release-please manifest with latest tag (v0.2.21) (#27)\n\nThe release-please manifest was bootstrapped at 0.2.18 in #25, but\nthree tags (v0.2.19, v0.2.20, v0.2.21) had been created manually\nsince then without CHANGELOG entries, and the local clone hadn''t\nfetched them when the bootstrap value was chosen.\n\nResult: the auto-generated Release PR (#26) proposed v0.2.19 — a\ntag that already exists pointing to a different commit (518b19c).\nMerging it would either fail or force-update the existing tag,\nbreaking pinned consumers.\n\nAligning the manifest to 0.2.21 (the real Latest) lets release-please\nrecompute correctly. The next qualifying commit on main will bump to\nv0.2.22 / v0.3.0 from there.\n\nThis will also auto-close PR #26 on the next release-please run, since\nthe only commits between v0.2.21 and HEAD are `ci:` (hidden).","tree":{"sha":"85e74b638961cc23d031b0364372258f91308a60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/85e74b638961cc23d031b0364372258f91308a60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/8d78c0fc3379ac462c52cbfe59eb009474bfdb75","verification":{"payload":"tree 85e74b638961cc23d031b0364372258f91308a60\nparent 6568638187ace597b91a4a2335676cb73f962151\nauthor David Arce <davidarce2915@gmail.com> 1777654549 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777654549 +0200\n\nchore: align release-please manifest with latest tag (v0.2.21) (#27)\n\nThe release-please manifest was bootstrapped at 0.2.18 in #25, but\nthree tags (v0.2.19, v0.2.20, v0.2.21) had been created manually\nsince then without CHANGELOG entries, and the local clone hadn''t\nfetched them when the bootstrap value was chosen.\n\nResult: the auto-generated Release PR (#26) proposed v0.2.19 — a\ntag that already exists pointing to a different commit (518b19c).\nMerging it would either fail or force-update the existing tag,\nbreaking pinned consumers.\n\nAligning the manifest to 0.2.21 (the real Latest) lets release-please\nrecompute correctly. The next qualifying commit on main will bump to\nv0.2.22 / v0.3.0 from there.\n\nThis will also auto-close PR #26 on the next release-please run, since\nthe only commits between v0.2.21 and HEAD are `ci:` (hidden).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp9NsVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEtEQAKcfGIb/LxW4O84EuR3AGMQE\nBckZSJaYRyt0+D36buurKy71kT0PQK5yhCe1jVxF7TDsqVNMNkImCcVYA+5Axa3Y\nNBYE+7NwozCZ7DK766u2CF9+TNqhFNMCyYz2zSpyIRJFUZHnG9zgvOqhRq8sC+KQ\nMQ/Qej0bt3EbwvfskCbisNY7p+yMT0ppc6DNSbzGicqISNQ0eFtRRL22SiAd3SZM\ndThZtxFbYedwY2qqmGNyB0J9xOM845IJLS+WvB6viXpnocoMdhl+uX2oR8HpeUCF\n85peA+xeAJisxnQl8zlEasL6PAc62cqW/SmI96cvFb4RUsH8NP339QuwcO0QfHSb\nFKJVBnrJJheBnXQhtav4Vj5fdiQ3vx7yF0shiTMKyqOUs6cVOxek+P/98wYHjeHx\nH4fFxnBzjp8Bperh5SeEHaRF6ZAX6IBuI1sZJDlrZ01uXCtp/OD8HAgKuwmHGWw/\n7tFeNEanXGW9hBk2zzoGcKYJgzHv0ioGn81eduQPBYfnjP+vN+LP0