d Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T16:35:56Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"ci: automate releases with release-please\n\nReplace the manual `git tag && git push --tags` workflow with\nrelease-please. On every push to `main`, release-please opens (or\nupdates) a Release PR with the next SemVer bump and an auto-generated\nCHANGELOG diff. Merging the Release PR tags the commit and publishes\nthe GitHub Release as Latest — the tag DevRune installs resolve to.\n\n- `release-type: simple` (content repo, no language artifacts).\n- Manifest bootstrapped at `0.2.18` so the next release picks up where\n  manual tagging left off.\n- `bump-minor-pre-major: true`: pre-1.0 `feat!:` bumps minor, not major.\n- `chore`, `docs`, `test`, `ci`, `build`, `style` are hidden from the\n  changelog. Catalog content updates should land as `feat`/`fix`/\n  `refactor`/`perf` from now on.\n\nREADME documents the new flow so contributors know not to tag manually.\n\nCloses #24","tree":{"sha":"52b236ae0de82a7147b16955bfffc45c7fefb9ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/52b236ae0de82a7147b16955bfffc45c7fefb9ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/aa85aac2180fc42fabe6c7b44c3dbfbde7b7d415","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","receiv