oss-agent notes from REGISTRY.claude.md (Claude is the sole\n  reader; notes targeted at OpenCode/Copilot/Codex/Factory are noise).\n- Tighten cross-agent notes in REGISTRY.md to drop the \"Claude\" mention\n  (file is consumed by OpenCode/Copilot/Codex/Factory only).\n\nRefs: #19\nPaired with: davidarce/DevRune#51\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cff166794e6f0208251ef003ebf82926986a4e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/cff166794e6f0208251ef003ebf82926986a4e55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/4c21c1db6960093062816fa6660e06769f344fae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commit/4c21c1db6960093062816fa6660e06769f344fae","node_id":"C_kwDORwxuadoAKDRjMjFjMWRiNjk2MDA5MzA2MjgxNmZhNjY2MGUwNjc2OWYzNDRmYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dav