i.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/6f869051aa0b7e44c24544e254d2494176be9298"}],"sha":"518b19cee7601ee936ea94a7e90c1dd0fdc4eef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/518b19cee7601ee936ea94a7e90c1dd0fdc4eef1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/6f869051aa0b7e44c24544e254d2494176be9298/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T15:59:23Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T15:59:23Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"fix(sdd): complete adviser→advisor rename in workflow + skills\n\nThe previous rename (a7f5418) renamed the skill directories but left\nbehind references to the legacy \"adviser\" naming in the SDD workflow\nmetadata. As a result, fresh installs still produced a duplicate\n\"Adviser/Advisor\" row in the model selection step and an `sdd-adviser`\nsub-agent entry in opencode.json.\n\nThis change finishes the migration:\n\n- workflow.yaml: role `sdd-adviser` → `sdd-advisor`, sentinel skill\n  pattern `*-adviser` → `*-advisor`, decisionRules text updated\n- ORCHESTRATOR.{md,claude.md,copilot.md,opencode.md}: all narrative\n  references and the `{WORKFLOW_MODEL_ADVISER}` placeholder updated to\n  the new name\n- _shared/adviser-templates.md → advisor-templates.md (file renamed +\n  contents updated; ORCHESTRATOR refs follow)\n- sdd-plan/SKILL.md: `<!-- ADVISER_TABLE_PLACEHOLDER -->` →\n  `<!-- ADVISOR_TABLE_PLACEHOLDER -->`; narrative refs updated\n- sdd-review/SKILL.md, sdd-implement/SKILL.md, sdd-plan/templates,\n  _shared/envelope-contract.md, _shared/launch-templates.copilot.md:\n  prose updated\n- skills/*-advisor/{SKILL.md,gotchas.md}: residual \"Adviser Mode\"\n  headings and engram titles updated\n\nThe DevRune CLI keeps the legacy `ADVISER_TABLE_PLACEHOLDER` marker and\nthe `sdd-adviser` model-override key as one-release compat shims so\nolder catalogs continue to work during the transition.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8af2c9ecdcb178ed4f69bc3e3bcc408eef7537d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/8af2c9ecdcb178ed4f69bc3e3bcc408eef7537d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/6f869051aa0b7e44c24544e254d2494176be9298","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","or