/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/59ca673c46da5bf42f6020bf448c2dac5f4f7118/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T11:53:47Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T11:53:47Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"docs(readme): rewrite as DevRune''s native content source\n\n- Reframe the catalog as \"the native content source for DevRune and\n  the home of SDD\" — not just a list of skills.\n- Add dedicated Spec-Driven Development section: 4-phase diagram with\n  model assignments, Advisor Strategy guidance loop, compaction\n  recovery per agent, and an annotated tree of workflows/sdd/ with a\n  suggested reading order (REGISTRY → ORCHESTRATOR → envelope →\n  launch-templates).\n- Split skills into advisers vs workflow-direct; group rules by\n  category (API / Architecture / Tech / Testing).\n- Add a Catalog Contract section with SKILL.md, workflow.yaml, and\n  tool-recipe schemas so communities can fork and build their own.\n- Add Contributing section emphasizing the fork-friendly, content-only\n  design.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"586ff672d0a1e0e7982280df946e4df708c2d4f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/586ff672d0a1e0e7982280df946e4df708c2d4f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/59ca673c46da5bf42f6020bf448c2dac5f4f7118","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verifi