, not hardcoded list\n\nTwo bugs fixed in sdd-plan SKILL.md:\n\n1. Step 7 had hardcoded triggers (3+ layers → architect, new API →\n   api-first, frontend → component) that missed testing, a11y, and\n   microfrontend advisers. Now: if step 5 selected ANY advisers →\n   return guidance_requested. The selection logic belongs in step 5,\n   the request is unconditional in step 7.\n\n2. Crit re-entry completely blocked guidance — even if crit feedback\n   said \"get an architect opinion on this\". Now: crit re-entry can\n   re-evaluate Team Selection and return guidance_requested if the\n   feedback introduces new concerns needing specialist review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db06a445c0dfa98eaa635bdb4981c622b5104d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/db06a445c0dfa98eaa635bdb4981c622b5104d25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/8305da2b594861be957fcc13d847dcd808404150","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscrip