-04-16T10:22:15Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"fix: hook scripts search subdirectories for .sdd/*/state.yaml\n\nHooks used a simple glob (.sdd/*/state.yaml) that only found workflows\nat the project root. When the SDD workspace is inside a subdirectory\n(e.g. mic-icbffpprec/.sdd/), the hooks missed it entirely.\n\nNow uses find with maxdepth 3 to search root + one level of subdirs.\nAlso fixed session-compact.sh to output the full relative path to\nstate.yaml instead of hardcoded .sdd/{change}/state.yaml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdb2b9aaa71cf4340d075c6b5785b01511abadc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/fdb2b9aaa71cf4340d075c6b5785b01511abadc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/commits/93e1bc9194b82b69245ddcceb00c6cd7782a6499","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":