ers/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/commits/d67713f9500525e272201bdd7e8078ccd2c29789/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:16:46Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:16:46Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat: advisor strategy — guidance loop, model placeholder, adviser mode\n\nImplement Anthropic''s Advisor Strategy pattern in the SDD workflow:\n\nOrchestrator changes:\n- Add guidance_requested branch to Post-Phase Protocol (all 3 variants)\n- Add sdd-adviser role with {WORKFLOW_MODEL_ADVISER} placeholder\n- Add adviser row to Phase-to-Model Table\n\nNew files:\n- _shared/adviser-templates.md with 4 templates (parallel, sequential,\n  copilot @agent-name, plan re-entry with guidance)\n\nsdd-plan changes:\n- Replace Step 7 inline adviser spawning with guidance_requested envelope\n- Add Step 8 Guidance Integration re-entry path\n- Revise Step 5 Team Selection to identify (not spawn) advisers\n\nAdviser skills:\n- Add Adviser Mode section to all 7 adviser SKILL.md files\n- Structured output format (Strengths/Issues/Recommendations)\n- Engram persistence with observation ID return\n\nEnvelope:\n- Add guidance_requested status with Requested Advisers and Guidance Context\n  fields integrated directly in template\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a01372031d7f117cbfbe2d76d7a120875f6d0470","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog/git/trees/a01372031d7f117cbfbe2d76d7a120875f6d0470"},"ur