/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/208ef4436594c52372343cb6acbc6867faeb47d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:28:09Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:28:09Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(theme): revive the dead data-mts-theme overrides on the real data-mts-mode system\n\n6 component CSS still keyed dark/light overrides on `[data-mts-theme]`, an attribute\nthat no longer exists (the theme system is `data-mts-mode`), so the overrides never\napplied — e.g. the slider rail and kanban count were near-invisible in dark modes,\nand calendar event colors used their dark values in light mode. Since `light` is the\nonly light mode, swapped the selectors: `[data-mts-theme=\"light\"]` → `[data-mts-mode=\"light\"]`,\n`[data-mts-theme=\"dark\"]` → `[data-mts-mode]:not([data-mts-mode=\"light\"])` (covers all 8\ndark modes). Values use the mode-inverting gray scale, so they adapt per mode. Same rot\nclass as the tooltip fix; 0 `data-mts-theme` left in any CSS. build + smoke green.","tree":{"sha":"58b4d0348b3734ae150f990c6d2e8135dc592a33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/58b4d0348b3734ae150f990c6d2e8135dc592a33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/208ef4436594c52372343cb6acbc6867faeb47d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://