{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/07a67cba3e0f49ddb9f3bb323fec1cfd371af078/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T22:44:09Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T22:44:09Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"refactor(i18n): rename registerLocale→registerLanguage + Locales→Languages (with aliases)\n\nThe public i18n API was renamed locale→language (setLanguage/getLanguage/getString)\nbut the registration/storage side kept \"Locale\": registerLocale, MTS.Locales,\nMTS.DataTable.registerLocale, MTS.Calendar.registerLocale, MTS.CalendarLocales.\nSince the system keys by plain language codes (es/en/pt), \"language\" is the accurate\nword; \"locale\" now only survives where it''s a real Intl locale (numberinput/date-picker\nes-CL, untouched).\n\nbase/matios-ui-i18n.js: MTS.registerLanguage, MTS.Languages, MTS._language — each old\nname kept as an alias so nothing breaks (npm consumers, external code). Swept the 89\ncomponent -i18n.js from registerLocale→registerLanguage (incl. the load guard). Calendar\n+ DataTable registration renamed with aliases too. build + smoke green (154 MTS entries).","tree":{"sha":"5fe7d2b2c973a4712520d285e79a7818a78f4761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/5fe7d2b2c973a4712520d285e79a7818a78f4761"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/07a67cba3e0f49ddb9f3bb323fec1cfd371af078","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","even