ml_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/e013b199f5aa8f2df8af0200ce790e77bc96f2ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T17:48:42Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T17:48:42Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(tooltip): neutral dark variant that renders correctly on every theme\n\nThe dark variant used var(--mts-gray-900) with a [data-mts-theme=\"dark\"] override\nto flip in dark mode. The gray scale inverts per mode (gray-900 is near-white in\ndark themes) and data-mts-theme no longer exists (the real system is data-mts-mode),\nso in any dark mode the tooltip got a near-white background with #fff text — an\ninvisible/\"transparent\"-looking tooltip. Switched to the inverse-surface tokens\n(background: --mts-text-primary; color: --mts-text-inverse), which are defined and\npaired for contrast in every mode/accent: dark tooltip on light themes, light tooltip\non dark themes. Arrow colors follow. Dropped the dead data-mts-theme overrides.\n\nNote: 6 other component CSS files still carry the same dead data-mts-theme selector\n(badge, progress, slider, fileupload, kanban, calendar) — separate cleanup.","tree":{"sha":"0794e15a8613a36fe4133e8ba4666070d95aafe0","url":"htt