the active mode/accent.\n- change_log_v103.md (root): user-facing notes for 1.0.3 (the docs/i18n audit).","tree":{"sha":"61aa470c3838eb0f1d98665e36c70c3ae4c95ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/61aa470c3838eb0f1d98665e36c70c3ae4c95ac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/59e7bda8d8c92d77ee75f8bfd36e625dd086425d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/59e7bda8d8c92d77ee75f8bfd36e625dd086425d","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKDU5ZTdiZGE4ZDhjOTJkNzdlZTc1ZjhiZmQzNmU2MjVkZDA4NjQyNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277","sha":"578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277"}],"sha":"59e7bda8d8c92d77ee75f8bfd36e625dd086425d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/59e7bda8d8c92d77ee75f8bfd36e625dd086425d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T14:04:14Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T14:04:14Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(demos): align tooltip + modal demos with the real API\n\n- tooltip: the initAll() section used data-tooltip* attributes, but\n  MTS.Tooltip.initAll() reads data-mts-tooltip* — so those tooltips never\n  initialized. Renamed the demo attributes (and the matching narrative strings)\n  to data-mts-tooltip*.\n- modal: MTS.Modal.confirm() takes confirmLabel/cancelLabel/variant, not\n  confirm/cancel/danger — the demo''s custom labels were silently ignored.\n  Switched both call sites to the documented option names.","tree":{"sha":"e04af1b5734d276325fe72536d01a35807bb69f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/e04af1b5734d276325fe72536d01a35807bb69f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKDU3OGM0MmNiZmVkNzYzOTZkNjVmZmM0YjI2YzQ5OGMyZTYzMzYyNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27","sha":"49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27"}],"sha":"578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/578c42cbfed76396d65ffc4b26c498c2e6336277"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T13:33:00Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T13:33:00Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"chore(date-picker): remove dead pre-modular monolith matios-ui-date-picker.js\n\nThe modular implementation (matios-ui-date-picker-base.js + the -date/-time/\n-datetime/-daterange/-month/-week plugins) is the live one — it defines\nMTS.DatePicker as a namespace with .Base/.Date/… subclasses and is what every\ndemo loads. The old monolith defined MTS.DatePicker as a single class, had zero\nreferences anywhere, and collided in the bundle (its `MTS.DatePicker = class`\noverwrote the modular namespace in dist). Removing it aligns the published\nbundle with the source/demos.","tree":{"sha":"1207c005809026b7faed42e9b0143780cf90a980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/1207c005809026b7faed42e9b0143780cf90a980"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKDQ5NTQ4Yzc3YTYwZDg1NmM2MzE3ZWFjNmE1ZDVmYTYzYjAzMGJlMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/b02e7a8371ee7d26579348464f13879f5b7668bc","sha":"b02e7a8371ee7d26579348464f13879f5b7668bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/b02e7a8371ee7d26579348464f13879f5b7668bc"}],"sha":"49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/49548c77a60d856c6317eac6a5d5fa63b030be27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/b02e7a8371ee7d26579348464f13879f5b7668bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T13:18:47Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T13:18:47Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"docs+i18n+fix: Forms + Button family + Base/Grid help .md from code (audit A.28–A.37)\n\nClose the js→md help-docs audit (A.28–A.37): each .md now reflects the real\ncomponent API (options/methods/events/enums/defaults), with i18n as the only\n.js-editable surface plus direct fixes for real errors.\n\n- Forms (A.28–A.35): docs aligned to code; validation rule messages made\n  internal (MTS.Validate._messages, no registerLocale); registerLocale removed\n  as a documented override across ~27 .md; otp tables un-escaped; itemlist\n  i18n file added; formlayout demo JavaScript tab now mirrors the form via the\n  DOM API + MTS.Input/MTS.Button (no innerHTML).\n- Button family (A.36): documented MTS.MenuButton / MTS.SplitButton (were\n  missing); fixed copybutton onCopy payload ({type,detail:{text}}); wired\n  hardcoded Spanish chrome to i18n (button \"Actions\", label \"optional\",\n  copybutton \"Copy\"/\"Copied!\", confirmbutton \"Delete\"/\"Confirm?\"/\"No\") — English\n  fallback when i18n isn''t loaded.\n- Base/Grid (A.37): rewrote the base theme docs to the real data-mts-mode +\n  data-mts-accent system (the documented data-mts-theme/ocean did not exist);\n  base CSS grid doc completed (column-count shortcuts, auto-fill/fit, col-full).\n- Removed the Changelog section from help .md across the set.","tree":{"sha":"988c73caac815bbc8db602f7bf1f4d5cba8b7d20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/988c73caac815bbc8db602f7bf1f4d5cba8b7d20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/b02e7a8371ee7d26579348464f13879f5b7668bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"ht