MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/ffe1e8b8d8031f65e1776f4efe74e98708ea0fb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T02:09:56Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T02:09:56Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"docs+i18n: Utilities help .md from code (audit A.24–A.27) + i18n wiring\n\nDirection js→md: every Utilities help .md rewritten from the actual code.\nRemoved invented options/methods, corrected contracts (getConfig descriptor,\nHttpClient envelope, JsonViewer options), fixed Install paths, dropped Changelog.\n\nDocs: httpclient (never-rejecting envelope client), codeblock, jsonviewer,\ndiagnosticspanel, browser (env detection), sanitize (XSS), pageloader,\nsessiontimeout, lockscreen, devpanel (getConfig/getCode harness).\n\ni18n: wired hardcoded component chrome to the global API (MTS.getString / _t\nhelper) with es/en/pt keys — httpclient (envelope messages), codeblock (copy),\njsonviewer (16 keys), diagnosticspanel (~24 keys), sessiontimeout (modal chrome),\ndevpanel (NEW -i18n.js file created). browser/sanitize/pageloader/lockscreen\nalready correct.\n\nAll modified .js pass node --check. dist/ needs a rebuild to pick up the .js changes.","tree":{"sha":"9aecc901871ecfd4f85f2c29359825cf4631b9b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/9aecc901871ecfd4f85f2c29359825cf4631b9b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/ffe1e8b8d8031f65e1776f4efe74e98708ea0fb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.git