thub.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/9f6e9c645f013d8f6ec4787422d564941f656bda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T01:22:33Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T01:22:33Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"docs+i18n: Layout + Navigation help .md from code (audit A.15–A.23)\n\nDirection js→md: every Layout and Navigation help .md rewritten from the actual\ncode. Removed invented API (whole sections in some cases — e.g. sidenav was\nalmost entirely fictional), corrected defaults/signatures/enums/event payloads,\ndropped fabricated Accessibility sections, removed Changelog sections.\n\nDocs — Layout: grid, shell, splitter, scroll, scrollspy, intersectionreveal,\ndashboardgrid. Navigation: menu, topbar, tabs, drawer, sidenav, accordion,\ndropdown, paneldropdown, contextmenu, breadcrumb, pagination, stepper,\nstepprogress (deprecated alias of Stepper), tabbar, statusbar, commandpalette.\n\ni18n: wired hardcoded component chrome to the global API (MTS.getString / _t\nhelper) with es/en/pt keys — dashboardgrid (NEW -i18n.js file created),\nsidenav (collapse/expand), drawer (closeLabel), breadcrumb (navLabel/expandLabel),\npagination (empty/info/rows/jump), commandpalette (placeholder/hints/noResults).\n\nAll modified .js pass node --check. dist/ needs a rebuild to pick up the .js changes.","tree":{"sha":"aa7888d6d097c0e6e9ae3a3bb102d433ae5dbacf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mat