ntent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/9088e379da8f7d2fb399800880b961e165ef8f50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T00:16:14Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T00:16:14Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"docs+i18n+fix: Display help .md from code (audit A.11–A.14) + i18n wiring + error fixes\n\nDirection js→md: every Display help .md rewritten from the actual code.\nRemoved invented options/methods/CSS classes, corrected defaults, signatures,\nenum values and event payloads, dropped Changelog sections.\n\nDocs: card, avatar, tree, timeline, kpicard (MTS.KPICard), countdown,\nemptystate, imagegallery, ratingreview, sortablelist, virtuallist,\nmarkdownviewer.\n\ni18n: wired hardcoded component chrome to the global API (MTS.getString / _t\nhelper) with es/en/pt keys — avatar (avatarLabel), countdown (unit labels),\nimagegallery (all/empty), ratingreview (reviews/yourRating + drop es-CL locale),\nemptystate (preset titles/descriptions), sortablelist (handle/move labels).\n\nError fixes (authorized):\n- MTS.Avatar: add real update(options) method (demo called a nonexistent update)\n- MTS.Tree: expandAll2() -> expandAll() (internal prop renamed; expandAll2 kept\n  as deprecated alias); public option expandAll unchanged\n- MTS.VirtualList: add scrollToIndex(i) alias (demo called a nonexistent method)\n- MTS.MarkdownViewer: fix table cell splitting to de-escape \\| (3rd parser with\n  the raw split(''|'') bug, matching the explorer/demo-shared fixes)\n- MTS.Infinite: remove duplicate load/error emits (handlers fired twice)\n\nAll modified .js pass node --check. dist/ needs a rebuild to pick up the .js changes.","tree":{"sha":"76cc781a6a30ae20b8201974b773fa274616adc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/76cc781a6a30ae20b8201974b773fa274616adc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/9088e379da8f7d2fb399800880b961e165ef8f50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/9088e379da8f7d2fb399800880b961e165ef8f50","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKDkwODhlMzc5ZGE4ZjdkMmZiMzk5ODAwODgwYjk2MWUxNjVlZjhmNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/bd2bf78c1d772bc601ae7023dbaab74906cacccb","sha":"bd2bf78c1d772bc601ae7023dbaab74906cacccb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/bd2bf78c1d772bc601ae7023dbaab74906cacccb"}],"sha":"9088e379da8f7d2fb399800880b961e165ef8f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/9088e379da8f7d2fb399800880b961e165ef8f50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/bd2bf78c1d772bc601ae7023dbaab74906cacccb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T21:24:42Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T21:24:42Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"docs+i18n: align component help .md with real code (audit A.1–A.10) + wire hardcoded chrome to i18n\n\nDirection js→md: every help .md rewritten from the actual code (options,\nevents, methods, enums, defaults). Removed invented API, corrected wrong\ndefaults/signatures, dropped Changelog sections (they live in CHANGELOG.md).\n\nDocs updated:\n- Boards: gantt-chart, kanban, sprint-board\n- Charts: chart (base+Bar/Grouped/Stacked), line, pie, composite, flow,\n  indicators, statistical, temporal; NEW chart-area-stacked.md;\n  removed 2 empty orphan stubs (charts.js/.md)\n- Widgets: calendar, datatable, documentmanager (already aligned)\n- Data: table (pure-CSS class ref), infinite\n- Overlays: modal, alert, toast, tooltip, popover, badge, progress,\n  spinner, skeleton, lightbox\n\ni18n: wired hardcoded/missing component chrome to the global API\n(MTS.getString / _t helper) with es/en/pt keys — infinite (loader/end/empty),\nalert (closeLabel), modal (confirm/alert/prompt chrome), badge (removeLabel),\nlightbox (close/prev/next/download/counter). All modified .js pass node --check.","tree":{"sha":"846d88b0fef599bd737f341c2384c88de90bbef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/846d88b0fef599bd737f341c2384c88de90bbef3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/bd2bf78c1d772bc601ae7023dbaab74906cacccb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url"