":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/98f9cdbf25e8f70076191111c644d38f0b9058bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T19:06:49Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T19:06:49Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(demos): English-default demos + markdown table viewer honors escaped pipes\n\n- Demos: datatable demo_2–10 + dashboard + calendar now load base/matios-ui-i18n.js and\n  call MTS.setLanguage(''en'') at startup. They were falling back to the framework default\n  (''es'') chrome after the per-instance `locale` option was removed. Dropped the now-dead\n  `locale:''en''` from demo_8 and dashboard.\n- Docs viewer: renderMd (index.html) and mdToHtml (support/demo-shared.js) now honor\n  escaped pipes (\\|) inside markdown table cells via a splitCells helper — the naive\n  split(''|'') was splitting on them and shifting the columns. Reverted the DocumentManager\n  middot workaround back to standard \\| in table cells.","tree":{"sha":"19f9a8c1c85bf1e536204d3a2e78ee2334f94779","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/19f9a8c1c85bf1e536204d3a2e78ee2334f94779"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/98f9cdbf25e8f70076191111c644d38f0b9058bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu