tps://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/9e55638d15e6bc73e340aa9b364c5ddd329ca730/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T03:05:04Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T03:05:04Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"i18n: single global language API (getString) + DocumentManager docs\n\ni18n\n- Rename MTS.getMessages -> MTS.getString across all consumers (.js and demo .html).\n- Single global entry point: MTS.setLanguage / MTS.getLanguage / MTS.getString.\n- Remove the per-instance `locale` option (DataTable, Calendar, CalendarUI now read\n  the language solely from MTS.getLanguage(), which defaults to ''es'').\n- Remove the setLocale/getLocale aliases and the DataTable/Calendar getLocale shims.\n- Guard the readers so components degrade gracefully when the i18n bundle isn''t loaded.\n\nDocs\n- Rewrite the DocumentManager plugin docs from the real source (inside-out: Upload,\n  Workflow, Preview + panels, ContextMenu, host); fix wrong option defaults; sync\n  demo_11''s shown code with what actually runs. Per-plugin docs kept.\n- Drop the Changelog section from component help docs (it lives in CHANGELOG.md).\n- Markdown table union types use a middot instead of an escaped pipe (the explorer''s\n  md viewer breaks on `\\|` inside table cells).\n\nAlso included from the same cycle (see CHANGELOG.md): DataTable {url} params,\nFilterPlugin optionsSource method/params/headers, Calendar enums/commit()/pt locale,\nDatePicker linkRange with time, Accordion max-height, input autofill fix.","tree":{"sha":"c55fa6f82feedda7befa8dcfcd4fd40f0c7410fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/c55fa6f82feedda7befa8dcfcd4fd40f0c7410fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/9e55638d15e6bc73e340aa9b364c5ddd329ca730","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/9e55638d15e6bc73e340aa9b364c5ddd329ca730","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKDllNTU2MzhkMTVlNmJjNzNlMzQwYWE5YjM2NGM1ZGRkMzI5Y2E3MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/865a8707f873cb35f91d8531995168