":{"date":"2026-06-29T23:11:18Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(showcase): remove stray ''...'' token breaking the login page script\n\nA leftover ellipsis on its own line (between submitLogin and escapeHtml) was a\nSyntaxError (''Unexpected token ...'') that aborted the whole inline script, so the\nlogin form never built (only static bits showed). Removed it; the form (inputs,\npassword reveal, OTP toggle, remember-me, submit) now renders. No code was missing —\nthe token elided nothing. Pre-existing, unrelated to the icon migration.","tree":{"sha":"3317a7b6ec14e02408537ae9a0221d2d1278dff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/3317a7b6ec14e02408537ae9a0221d2d1278dff5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/a2f29055666101ffabd0e2e12d243bc098170c20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"