.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(demos): load icons.js statically in all demos; revert demo-shared icon-load hack\n\nREGRESSION FIX: the MTS.Icon migration made components depend on the icon registry,\nbut ~55 demos never loaded icons/matios-ui-icons.js. Two init-time paths crashed in\nthose demos: demo-shared''s group launcher (MTS.Accordion -> Icon.get) and codeblock''s\nMTS.CopyButton (-> Icon.get). The copybutton-only async gate in demo-shared was\ninsufficient (didn''t cover the launcher or codeblock) and wrongly coupled a core dep to\nthe demo harness. Now: icons.js is loaded statically by every demo (119/119), like\nbase.css and component JS; demo-shared.js reverted to a pure harness. The component''s\nonly icon dependency is the framework registry (MTS.Icon), never a demo file.\nVerified the previously-crashing paths render clean (modal codeblock, forms launcher);\nsmoke 222/222.","tree":{"sha":"1265d0997d20eb0c1c95fa9abb570fc3d3d7c1df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/1265d0997d20eb0c1c95fa9abb570fc3d3d7c1df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/b501e411c8fe0b82cfc6a7a90ccfc1c9fc7eeb3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_u