ras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/4ee785b1938b86b71324764e420a7284357b745f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T16:40:53Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T16:40:53Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"docs: v1.0.0 release notes, browser matrix (ES2020), SemVer + RELEASING — Step 4\n\n- CHANGELOG.md: cut [1.0.0] (first public release) consolidating tooling\n  (npm/esbuild dist, TypeScript .d.ts, smoke+CI), features and fixes from this cycle.\n- README: ''Browser support'' (Chrome/Edge 80+, Firefox 78+, Safari 14+; ES2020,\n  no transpiler/polyfills) + ''Versioning'' (SemVer) sections.\n- scripts/build.js: pin esbuild output to the ES2020 browser target.\n- package.json: browserslist matching the matrix.\n- RELEASING.md: SemVer policy + release checklist + docs-site (GitHub Pages from\n  branch root, static, no workflow) + maintainer note (manual publish, by design).","tree":{"sha":"662aa52fbed1c6930e677758a354144e7cc68d42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matio