"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T01:54:22Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"test: zero-dep smoke test + CI (catches load/TDZ regressions)\n\n- test/smoke.js: pure-Node smoke test. Evaluates every component .js in a\n  browser-like stub and asserts each loads without throwing and that the global\n  MTS namespace is populated. Reproduces the exact TDZ cascade\n  (''Cannot access MTS before initialization'' -> ''MTS is not defined'') that broke\n  the DataTable stack, which node --check could not catch.\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: runs node test/smoke.js on push/PR (no install).\n- test/README.md: how to run + what it covers.\n- 222 component scripts load clean; verified the suite fails when a TDZ is present.","tree":{"sha":"ce8d29982a0967f9324033c7fb8193c762a9c225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/ce8d29982a0967f9324033c7fb8193c762a9c225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/768493f47a5116764030c6e18235a8b60172c22c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/768493f47a5116764030c6e18235a8b60172c22c","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKDc2ODQ5M2Y0N2E1MTE2NzY0MDMwYzZlMTgyMzVhOGI2MDE3MmMyMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88","sha":"7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88"}],"sha":"768493f47a5116764030c6e18235a8b60172c22c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/768493f47a5116764030c6e18235a8b60172c22c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T01:37:02Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T01:37:02Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"feat: PDF Acrobat icon, DocumentManager iconSize option, flat badges, var->let in i18n\n\n- icons: file-pdf now shows an ''A'' (Acrobat) mark instead of a stray ''S'',\n  consistent with file-word (W) / file-powerpoint (P). Generic letterform,\n  not Adobe''s trademarked logo.\n- DocumentManager: new iconSize option (default 20px, any CSS length) via\n  --mts-dm-icon-size; file icons bumped 16->20px for balance.\n- badge: removed the colored glow box-shadow on --primary/success/warning/\n  danger/accent variants (flat, modern look). Dropped the now-redundant\n  local override on the version badge.\n- i18n: var->let across 83 *-i18n.js files (89 decls). Codebase now has 0\n  declaration-site ''var'' outside demos. Self-referential namespace lines were\n  handled by the separate hotfix.\n- Verified in-browser: PDF ''A'' renders, icons 20px, badges flat, locales\n  register, 0 console errors.","tree":{"sha":"415b39ae412a939416510e69f93b5932ca52c227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/415b39ae412a939416510e69f93b5932ca52c227"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKDc5OTliMTM1NTZlM2JkYzg3MTRiYzJmYTM3MzZmMjgyYzFjNDBlODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/18c760568e33df99bb4286beba1155a9568fe60f","sha":"18c760568e33df99bb4286beba1155a9568fe60f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/18c760568e33df99bb4286beba1155a9568fe60f"}],"sha":"7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/7999b13556e3bdc8714bc2fa3736f282c1c40e88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/18c760568e33df99bb4286beba1155a9568fe60f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T01:35:05Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T01:35:05Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix: TDZ regression from var->let (let MTS = MTS || {} self-reference)\n\nThe var->let sweep (d42f37d) turned the namespace-init line\n''var MTS = MTS || {}'' into ''let MTS = MTS || {}'' in 3 datatable plugin\nfiles. With var, hoisting made the self-reference work; with let, the\nright-hand MTS hits its own TDZ -> ''Cannot access MTS before\ninitialization'', which aborted MTS setup and cascaded ''MTS is not\ndefined'' across the DataTable/DocumentManager stack.\n\nFixed to the codebase''s standard pattern: ''window.MTS = window.MTS || {}''.\nVerified: DocumentManager + explorer load with 0 console errors; MTS and\ncomponent locales initialize correctly. node --check does NOT catch TDZ,\nhence the in-browser runtime verification.","tree":{"sha":"aa067fb146597f18ad97515aa120f8f8ec6e00d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/aa067fb146597f18ad97515aa120f8f8ec6e00d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/18c760568e33df99bb4286beba1155a9568fe60f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followe