rl":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/c1a1dc31dec09d914870c249d6d5336b398ff072/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:22:24Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:22:24Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"feat(lockscreen): MTS.LockScreen - in-place re-authentication overlay\n\nFull-screen lock-screen-style overlay for re-auth without losing page context.\nUI + events only (delegates the check via onUnlock(password, done)); same pattern\nas MTS.SessionTimeout. Reuses MTS.Avatar (initials/color), MTS.Input (password,\nbrowser-off) and MTS.Button (busy). Focus trap + scroll lock + blur/solid privacy\ncover. New --mts-z-lockscreen token (800). i18n es/en/pt. Registered in the explorer.\nResolves handoff T-UIFW-LOCKSCREEN.","tree":{"sha":"2e43c6428cacf4f1cbf94007bb4c61bdda36b25e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/2e43c6428cacf4f1cbf94007bb4c61bdda36b25e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/c1a1dc31dec09d914870c249d6d5336b398ff072","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/c1a1dc31dec09d914870c249d6d5336b398ff072","node_id":"C_kwDORw8X4doAKGMxYTFkYzMxZGVjMDlkOTE0ODcwYzI0OWQ2ZDUzMzZiMzk4ZmYwNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commit/7657b4c1516beb828939787558fbbab6082c24f1","sha":"7657b4c1516beb828939787558fbbab6082c24f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/7657b4c1516beb828939787558fbbab6082c24f1"}],"sha":"c1a1dc31dec09d914870c249d6d5336b398ff072","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/c1a1dc31dec09d914870c249d6d5336b398ff072"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/commits/7657b4c1516beb828939787558fbbab6082c24f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T17:51:39Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T17:51:39Z","email":"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(input): idempotent validation render + guard selectOnFocus (prevent DOM-mutation loop)\n\n_renderValidation() now writes feedback className/textContent only when they change,\nand selectOnFocus only selects while the input is still the active element. Repeated\nfocus/blur/validate cycles no longer emit redundant DOM mutations that could drive an\nexternal MutationObserver / CSS :has() into an infinite loop. No behavior change.","tree":{"sha":"b71af7c15b709f0d99341f8b4ed8eefa610ebc74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/b71af7c15b709f0d99341f8b4ed8eefa610ebc74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/7657b4c1516beb828939787558fbbab6082c24f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repo