"25290231+gmocontreras@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"refactor(forms): consolidate shared field primitives into base.css + css-helpers demo\n\nSingle source of truth for .mts-label--required, .mts-form-hint and .mts-form-error:\nmoved to base/matios-ui-base.css (always loaded), de-duped from input/formlayout/label\nCSS. Fixes a latent bug where the contract''s .mts-form-error slot rendered unstyled on\npages that load a component (e.g. Select) without input.css.\n\n- base.css header note updated to carve out shared field primitives.\n- css-helpers/demo.html: new section 16 with live examples (required asterisk, hint, error).\n- FORM-FIELD-CONTRACT.md: CSS classes reference (shared + per-component error-state).","tree":{"sha":"89e4a9674ea28af8ca3099165b0f130c77a12bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/89e4a9674ea28af8ca3099165b0f130c77a12bd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/e61fb4b623aea5712112dbe6892e646c17a97fde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u