as@users.noreply.github.com","name":"GUILLERMO CONTRERAS"},"message":"fix(select): flip dropdown up when more room above + cap list to viewport\n\nResolves genesys handoff T-UIFW-SELECT-DROPDOWN-FLIP. _positionDropdown used a fixed\n''spaceBelow >= 120'' threshold that forced the dropdown downward even when it was taller\nthan the space below, clipping the last options off the viewport (e.g. a select low in\na modal). Now: open below only if it fits whole or below has more room than above, else\nflip up; and cap the scrollable list (.mts-select__list) to the available space so it\nscrolls instead of spilling. Repositions on scroll/resize keep the cap correct.\nVerified with a node harness (7/7).","tree":{"sha":"0af8664d197e2a21bc3eadbdfe72d24232fb6839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/trees/0af8664d197e2a21bc3eadbdfe72d24232fb6839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatiosSpa/matios-ui-framework/git/commits/2d8897c0963533c8f088919af74f416b5cdcb71d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25290231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmocontreras","id":25290231,"login":"gmocontreras","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjkwMjMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmocontreras/subs