ify observers.\n- Created interfaces for RiskAlertObserver and RiskAlertSubject to define observer behavior.\n- Developed AlertPresentationResolverService to resolve alert presentation strategies based on alert content.\n- Added specific strategies for different risk types: Flood, Landslide, Rain, and Default.\n- Updated NotificationService to utilize the new event bus for alert management.\n- Refactored DashboardComponent to display alerts using the new presentation model.\n- Enhanced CSS styles for visual differentiation of alert types.","tree":{"sha":"97cff945609741961525418ce0bb0c3ba4828cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdiRestrepo/risk-event-notification-fronted/git/trees/97cff945609741961525418ce0bb0c3ba4828cc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdiRestrepo/risk-event-notification-fronted/git/commits/e27ac876efce4d19aea46adbed78fdd202495262","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107229020?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EdiRestrepo","id":107229020,"login":"EdiRestrepo","node_id":"U_kgDOBmQvXA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EdiRestrepo/risk-