cation channels\n\n- Updated DashboardComponent to manage user session and display username.\n- Added CSS styles for the login component to enhance UI.\n- Redesigned login component HTML for better user experience and error handling.\n- Enhanced login logic in LoginComponent to include loading state and error messages.\n- Created AuthService with local user validation for demo purposes.\n- Introduced NotificationChannelFactory and NotificationChannel interface for managing notification channels.\n- Implemented various notification channels (SMS, Email, Push, WhatsApp) with respective classes.\n- Developed NotificationService to handle sending notifications through multiple channels.\n- Added UserPreferencesService to manage user notification preferences.\n- Updated global styles for consistent theming and responsive design.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab4f27b48aa8547e57208b279ea8acfb52d2faa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdiRestrepo/risk-event-notification-fronted/git/trees/ab4f27b48aa8547e57208b279ea8acfb52d2faa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdiRestrepo/risk-event-notification-fronted/git/commits/c1ca9d79f1efd879cea87eb8d58bd62459020fd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107229020?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EdiRestrepo","id":107229020,"login":"EdiRestrepo","node_id":"U_kgDOBmQvXA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdiRestrepo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/