nushkumarsivaji@gmail.com","name":"Dhanush kumar Sivaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T06:34:12Z","email":"dhanushkumarsivaji@gmail.com","name":"Dhanush kumar Sivaji"},"message":"feat: micro-frontend monorepo with Module Federation, routing, and auth\n\n- Shell (host, port 3000) + remote-app (port 3001) + @mfe/shared package\n- Webpack 5 Module Federation 2.2 via @module-federation/enhanced\n- Bidirectional navigation sync via custom NavigationBus (no shared react-router-dom singleton)\n- Remote uses state-based routing when federated to avoid \"Router inside Router\" conflicts\n- MSAL auth lives in shell only; remotes receive auth state via mount props\n- ProtectedRoute and role-based guards in shell, AuthContext in remotes\n- Auth/admin toggle switches in header for testing route guards\n- Shell exposes acquireToken and ErrorBoundary; remotes consume via federation\n- Standalone dev mode for remotes with BrowserRouter bridge\n- pnpm workspaces, Husky, commitlint, CI workflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"316a6b0dfc9c70b7181145419a2a146bc42eb7b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhanushkumarsivaji/microfrontend-template/git/trees/316a6b0dfc9c70b7181145419a2a146bc42eb7b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhanushkumarsivaji/microfrontend-template/git/commits/0311c419da1f0484572ffca0f3a64aaee342ff96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36889650?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhanushkumarsivaji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhanushkumarsivaji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhanushkumarsivaji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhanushkumarsivaji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dhanushkumarsivaji","id":36889650,"l