sers/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/a9713ea055d473f9f4cc515fac947a33e02c178c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:20:14Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:20:14Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"fix(designer): symmetric legacy-key round trip — hoist passthrough keys on load\n\nThe save path (serializePassthrough) preserves legacy top-level block keys\n(residual-key passthrough), but the LOAD path (migratePageSchemaV2ToV3 →\nnormalizeProps) swept those same keys into props — so after a reload the\ninspector (bound to top-level) read empty values even though the persisted\ndocument was correct. For PASSTHROUGH_BLOCK_TYPES the load now hoists\nprops entries back to the top level (skipping managed keys), making the\nsave/load round trip symmetric.\n\nworkbench-blocks-authoring 4/4 green (A1 metric-strip variant/metrics,\nA2 status-banner, A3 dependent).","tree":{"sha":"4789a841ad4b128aa4aa9b9c1063b1d644425f6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/4789a841ad4b128aa4aa9b9c1063b1d644425f6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/a9713ea055d473f9f4cc515fac947a33e02c178c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organ