om/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/8100ca0af84108974e8d273fd08b4fa35d471356/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:16:36Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:16:36Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"fix(platform): list active tenants without the tenant-line filter for background accessors\n\nBackground threads run outside any tenant context; the tenant-line\ninterceptor narrowed TenantService.getActiveTenants() to the default\nsystem tenant, so plugin schedulers silently lost every other tenant\n(observed: a two-tenant system listed only tenant 1, starving the OI\nmetric auto-refresh of its governing tenant).\n\nEscape the tenant-line filter for the enumeration — the accessor''s\ncontract is explicitly all active tenants for background iteration.","tree":{"sha":"f5b191791315c992820fb89d48805658869c133f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/f5b191791315c992820fb89d48805658869c133f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/8100ca0af84108974e8d273fd08b4fa35d471356","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user