eb-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commit/e8a293686018a7b612c250c334cb4e25018b15d7","node_id":"C_kwDORxGGitoAKGU4YTI5MzY4NjAxOGE3YjYxMmMyNTBjMzM0Y2I0ZTI1MDE4YjE1ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commit/5f491f2e1fc495e5b1bcd92a46f9582dff5ceb56","sha":"5f491f2e1fc495e5b1bcd92a46f9582dff5ceb56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/5f491f2e1fc495e5b1bcd92a46f9582dff5ceb56"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commit/8b555c56f44e93c0d574e35575f4031b6afb5cb6","sha":"8b555c56f44e93c0d574e35575f4031b6afb5cb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/8b555c56f44e93c0d574e35575f4031b6afb5cb6"}],"sha":"e8a293686018a7b612c250c334cb4e25018b15d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/e8a293686018a7b612c250c334cb4e25018b15d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/5f491f2e1fc495e5b1bcd92a46f9582dff5ceb56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:58:43Z","email":"ghjapple@163.com","name":"vavi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T03:58:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(decisionops): persist unsaved studio mapping drafts across locale switches (#2232)\n\n* feat(decisionops): add studio-scoped session archive to designer draft storage\n\nExtend the shared DecisionOps draft-storage module with a strategy-studio\ncontext: key prefix decisionops.studio.draft.<scope> (workbench scope by\ndefault) and a bindings-record snapshot shape with the same SSR-safe,\ncorruption-tolerant load/save/clear semantics as the event-policy designer\narchive.\n\n* fix(decisionops): persist unsaved studio mapping drafts across locale switches\n\nThe Strategy Studio workbench kept decision-binding mapping rows (renamed\nC1MAP-* inputs and field selections) in React state only, so the I18nContext\nlocale switch (window.location.reload) or any other full remount dropped them\nback to defaults. Mirror ruleBindingDrafts into the shared session archive on\nevery change, restore it on mount with the archive winning over built-in\ndefaults, gate writes behind the post-restore store scope, and mark binding\nentries persisted once their backend fragment save succeeds so the archive\nnever resurrects stale edits.\n\n* test(decisionops): cover studio mapping-draft persistence across remounts\n\nMirror the event-policy designer draft-persistence suite: remount restore of\nrenamed mapping rows and field selections, per-scenario binding scoping\nwithout cross-contamination, archive clearing after a backend save, and a\npersistence-disabled counter-evidence case reproducing the legacy loss.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed5018027ce3f4e25404c005625f9ff678db7dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/ed5018027ce3f4e25404c005625f9ff678db7dd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/5f491f2e1fc495e5b1bcd92a46f9582dff5ceb56","verification":{"payload":"tree ed5018027ce3f4e25404c005625f9ff678db7dd8\nparent d47c43a4b26ae03ab568d237adbd9750faef20cc\nauthor vavi <ghjapple@163.com> 1791345523 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791345523 +0800\n\nfix(decisionops): persist unsaved studio mapping drafts across locale switches (#2232)\n\n* feat(decisionops): add studio-scoped session archive to designer draft storage\n\nExtend the shared DecisionOps draft-storage module with a strategy-studio\ncontext: key prefix decisionops.studio.draft.<scope> (workbench scope by\ndefault) and a bindings-record snapshot shape with the same SSR-safe,\ncorruption-tolerant load/save/clear semantics as the event-policy designer\narchive.\n\n* fix(decisionops): persist unsaved studio mapping drafts across locale switches\n\nThe Strategy Studio workbench kept decision-binding mapping rows (renamed\nC1MAP-* inputs and field selections) in React state only, so the I18nContext\nlocale switch (window.location.reload) or any other full remount dropped them\nback to defaults. Mirror ruleBindingDrafts into the shared session archive on\nevery change, restore it on mount with the archive winning over built-in\ndefaults, gate writes behind the post-restore store scope, and mark binding\nentries persisted once their backend fragment save succeeds so the archive\nnever resurrects stale edits.\n\n* test(decisionops): cover studio mapping-draft persistence across remounts\n\nMirror the event-policy designer draft-persistence suite: remount restore of\nrenamed mapping rows and field selections, per-scenario binding scoping\nwithout cross-contamination, archive clearing after a backend save, and a\npersistence-disabled counter-evidence case reproducing the legacy loss.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxcNzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFpEQADtPDoGMll5OiZ/b1j7807dO\ng30jnWs2KKi1fqUHTVWV68aI2aoDU62m9tt8WC8xaaGrHtEpX1BqdyafEwQeakrz\nvGef8EC17lztBsYU1qo0bTo3BS8RV+3LlZ3lRG1MxPeHKF0dF9H2oGIkWTEcxbwm\nUQBWhLjKoyLMqawEY0JBsMV7jy6IGKts9qdKHkLVuZT8it8pJQt/JWahcvhu23Hj\nJ6RjX30HpqBzv325W/qcrujYWvOtfGcTUG2Zd7tcaFXmBPpDMZXzidpCORB5BWEA\n7kkEqkchdTiWbK/c+ehW+yAd2y3UNkOsZ5reNa7P12G0WgKloTMcDQlZ/rQRaHsP\n4v9TvNormA2saRRSQ/KdCgKxKbNrRUkRg2J2Ixmio4mH1WT2nPCUgTC5S5ceCb3R\nk9YJXH0fDFAH5NJ4IlYK07ibBFSHbtxXN0bX3Lj1NaIo6LfTmDDP2ipE1mjyAg1E\nUVBnCL02SbOgVzYIVYow+Rp+eep6axfMeHSynyoEgALpllKCrUc5ZLWldjcU+4zF\nHF6JECV/lvVTwtkMKZKH0f28enTGssPEzoG388Y0JhRlgDni4UeEP1bN6E669b6T\n7KkdEwOQbRbi2Z8nO+qGzfM+yRL0p/vSfZB4vsiII6ln3jKpEBdqt462mEWIjYZw\ntn5NJMd+kymeVohPaIpW\n=+GtZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T03:58:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"ht