","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/ebf272c39be922924fabf86a15e0a88b7d51e8d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:33:41Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:33:41Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"Materialize the bootstrap wildcard grant so tenant admins keep working\n\nThe tenant template grants tenant_admin the ''*'' wildcard, but the wildcard\nwas never materialized: createTemplatePermissions only registers the\ntemplate''s own 157 codes, so plugin imports later register codes (page\nschema, e2e models) that no role grants, and a freshly built stack''s\nadministrator fails every dynamic request. The bootstrap now creates a real\ntenant-scoped ''*'' permission when a binding references it and grants it to\nthe wildcard roles, and the permission check honors a granted ''*'' as\nmatch-all within the tenant. Existing stacks without the ''*'' row are\nunaffected.\n\nUnit tests cover both directions (wildcard authorizes a post-bootstrap\ncode; a non-wildcard subject stays denied). NOTE: :compileTestJava\ncurrently fails on pre-existing breakage unrelated to this change\n(WebhookIntegrationTest/TestSeedController cannot find symbols - files\nuntouched since the initial commit while main sources moved); the test run\nis blocked by that, to be fixed before the wildcard tests execute on CI.","tree":{"sha":"b4c0f74c6ae20fad0c02f0a25752ef50bcbbab61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/b4c0f74c6ae20fad0c02f0a25752ef50bcbbab61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/ebf272c39be922924fabf86a15e0a88b7d51e8d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commit/ebf272c39be922924fabf86a15e0a88b7d51e8d3","node_id":"C_kwDORxGGitoAKGViZjI3MmMzOWJlOTIyOTI0ZmFiZjg2YTE1ZTBhODhiN2Q1MWU4ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commit/20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb","sha":"20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb"}],"sha":"ebf272c39be922924fabf86a15e0a88b7d51e8d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/ebf272c39be922924fabf86a15e0a88b7d51e8d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizati