.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/20198c2bc9462d1e32b7a301db223b28788c929b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/1e0a7bfb98a0984c13e76687794f938f346eac7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:38:34Z","email":"ghjapple@163.com","name":"vavi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:38:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(decisionops): persist unsaved designer drafts across locale switches (#2224)\n\nRoot cause (EP-14/EP-23): I18nContext.handleSetLocale calls window.location.reload() on\nlocale switch, remounting the event policy designer and wiping its in-memory draft\n(rule renames, condition-group AST edits, decision mapping rows).\n\nFix: scoped sessionStorage archive keyed per policy code\n(decisionops.designer.draft.<policyCode>) written from EventPolicyDesignerWorkflow''s\ndraftJson on every change, restored on remount (archived draft wins over the stored\nversion hydration), and cleared once the draft is saved to the backend. Reload\nbehavior and all props/API/AST contracts are unchanged.\n\nTests: new vitest suite simulates the reload via full unmount/remount — restore of\nrule name + condition AST + mapping rows, per-policyCode isolation, archive cleared\nafter successful save, and a counter-evidence case reproducing the legacy draft loss\nwith persistence disabled.\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dbd8161d323b2d8f528aecb44195c0d7ec972dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/0dbd8161d323b2d8f528aecb44195c0d7ec972dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/1e0a7bfb98a0984c13e76687794f938f346eac7b","verification":{"payload":"tree 0dbd8161d323b2d8f528aecb44195c0d7ec972dd\nparent 20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb\nauthor vavi <ghjapple@163.com> 1791337114 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791337114 +0800\n\nfix(decisionops): persist unsaved designer drafts across locale switches (#2224)\n\nRoot cause (EP-14/EP-23): I18nContext.handleSetLocale calls window.location.reload() on\nlocale switch, remounting the event policy designer and wiping its in-memory draft\n(rule renames, condition-group AST edits, decision mapping rows).\n\nFix: scoped sessionStorage archive keyed per policy code\n(decisionops.designer.draft.<policyCode>) written from EventPolicyDesignerWorkflow''s\ndraftJson on every change, restored on remount (archived draft wins over the stored\nversion hydration), and cleared once the draft is saved to the backend. Reload\nbehavior and all props/API/AST contracts are unchanged.\n\nTests: new vitest suite simulates the reload via full unmount/remount — restore of\nrule name + condition AST + mapping rows, per-policyCode isolation, archive cleared\nafter successful save, and a counter-evidence case reproducing the legacy draft loss\nwith persistence disabled.\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxaKaCRC1aQ