/auraboot/commit/20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb","sha":"20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb"}],"sha":"1e0a7bfb98a0984c13e76687794f938f346eac7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/1e0a7bfb98a0984c13e76687794f938f346eac7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:23:07Z","email":"ghjapple@163.com","name":"vavi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:23:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: localize 4 user-facing bare strings (chart empty state, policy form placeholders, impact summary, 35000 envelope) (#2222)\n\n* fix(web): localize chart empty-state badge and event-policy form placeholders\n\nC1 bare-string remediation (2 of 4):\n- ChartEmptyState: the AWAITING DATA badge, no-data title and empty hint now\n  resolve through a chartEmptyState i18n catalog via useI18n().locale\n  (zh-CN 等待数据/暂无数据, en Awaiting data/No data yet), following the T4\n  catalog paradigm (i18n.json + Text.ts resolver). Authored title/description\n  props stay untranslated.\n- Event policy create/copy forms (EventPolicyListPage + EventPolicyActionsBlock):\n  the five raw-key placeholders (policyCode/policyName/eventType/targetType/\n  targetKey) now resolve through the eventPolicyForm catalog\n  (zh-CN 策略编码/策略名称/事件类型/目标类型/目标键, en Policy code/...).\n\nLocale-contract tests with negative probes added for both surfaces; no API\ncontract change, reactUserFacing static gate stays flat.\n\n* fix(platform): localize 35000 envelope and decision impact empty-consumers summary\n\nC1 bare-string remediation (2 of 4), following the established $i18n: boundary\nlocalization paradigm (I18nLocaleResolver + I18nService, query param > X-Locale >\nAccept-Language > zh-CN fallback):\n\n- DecisionImpactServiceImpl: the non-blocking decision-impact summary emitted the\n  bare English \"No downstream consumers\"; it now emits the stable\n  $i18n:decision.impact.no_downstream_consumers key, resolved by\n  DecisionRuntimeController at the response boundary (zh-CN 无下游引用方, en-US\n  No downstream consumers). \"Used by ...\" summaries and the field/integration\n  impact flows pass through untouched; response DTO shape unchanged.\n- GlobalExceptionHandler: every 35000 BadParam envelope (validation, constraint\n  violation, binding, temporal parse, business validation, malformed body,\n  method/media/multipart) carried the untranslated enum desc \"Bad parameter\";\n  the envelope message is now resolved per request locale (zh-CN 参数错误, en-US\n  Bad parameter) with zh-CN fallback and the legacy desc as the final floor.\n  Same code, fields, statuses — contract preserved.\n- seed/i18n-base.json: catalog entries common.error.badParam and\n  decision.impact.no_downstream_consumers (zh-CN/en-US/ja-JP/ko-KR).\n\nNote: GlobalExceptionHandlerI18nTest#metaAdviceDoesNotOverrideBusinessFailure\nWithItsPersistenceCause fails identically on pristine origin/main (pre-existing,\nunrelated); all new and existing localization tests pass on this branch.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"949abfbb6f6e4210d29d7bb5065dc366dde39583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/949abfbb6f6e4210d29d7bb5065dc366dde39583"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/20caf67afa4bc2b88f5c30d79eaa761fc36ea6cb","verification":{"payload":"tree 949abfbb6f6e4210d29d7bb5065dc366dde39583\nparent 4bee9788206f122a94ca1f7f1bb1466f63b523f1\nauthor vavi <ghjapple@163.com> 1791336187 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791336187 +0800\n\nfix: localize 4 user-facing bare strings (chart empty state, policy form placeholders, impact summary, 35000 envelope) (#2222)\n\n* fix(web): localize chart empty-state badge and event-policy form placeholders\n\nC1 bare-string remediation (2 of 4):\n- ChartEmptyState: the AWAITING DATA badge, no-data title and empty hint now\n  resolve through a chartEmptyState i18n catalog via useI18n().locale\n  (zh-CN 等待数据/暂无数据, en Awaiting data/No data yet), following the T4\n  catalog paradigm (i18n.json + Text.ts resolver). Authored title/description\n  props stay untranslated.\n- Event policy create/copy forms (EventPolicyListPage + EventPolicyActionsBlock):\n  the five raw-key placeholders (policyCode/policyName/eventType/targetType/\n  targetKey) now resolve through the eventPolicyForm catalog\n  (zh-CN 策略编码/策略名称/事件类型/目标类型/目标键, en Policy code/...).\n\nLocale-contract tests with negative probes added for both surfaces; no API\ncontract change, reactUserFacing static gate stays flat.\n\n* fix(platform): localize 35000 envelope and decision impact empty-consumers summary\n\nC1 bare-string remediation (2 of 4), following the established $i18n: boundary\nlocalization paradigm (I18nLocaleResolver + I18nService, query param > X-Locale >\nAccept-Language > zh-CN fallback):\n\n- DecisionImpactServiceImpl: the non-blocking decision-impact summary emitted the\n  bare English \"No downstream consumers\"; it now emits the stable\n  $i18n:decision.impact.no_downstream_consumers key, resolved by\n  DecisionRuntimeController at the response boundary (zh-CN 无下游引用方, en-US\n  No downstream consumers). \"Used by ...\" summaries and the field/integration\n  impact flows pass through untouched; response DTO shape unchanged.\n- GlobalExceptionHandler: every 35000 BadParam envelope (validation, constraint\n  violation, binding, temporal parse, business validation, malformed body,\n  method/media/multipart) carried the untranslated enum desc \"Bad parameter\";\n  the envelope message is now resolved per request locale (zh-CN 参数错误, en-US\n  Bad parameter) with zh-CN fallback and the legacy desc as the final floor.\n  Same code, fields, statuses — contract preserved.\n- seed/i18n-base.json: catalog entries common.error.badParam and\n  decision.impact.no_downstream_consumers (zh-CN/en-US/ja-JP/ko-KR).\n\nNote: GlobalExceptionHandlerI18nTest#metaAdviceDoesNotOverrideBusinessFailure\nWithItsPersistenceCause fails identically on pristine origin/main (pre-existing,\nunrelated); all new and existing localization tests pass on this branch.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxZ77CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAom0QABvL/fulTmwJglfNusKEHnRH\nDpeDwNy+bk3tVSFEeQ2qOHkH8D/ZRBTouYTGLTY4DzI/aUYIEI7PBdAmERPB+yUQ\nvr+WL3gDVlqAr/PcTE9dVHL+/epKiiN5JvshLcv0SLCRyZqzrsb2DeoQafD0cyDa\n8RXRW8IoamlBpaBdgJh4b+MCpXDDF/wjNzFuThcrG+VvWBBJKZmjwf6BcDeGRz1r\nQ/fd6k7r4LHUxha7DqrSr4SpMqtAZjlu213mJCuc10spDldo7EGkvaPiQUhwbo1n\nALt7Tf/AFnwUOTJ+/pb1vd0jHs/4wDG9CiMWhKqHh2gPaaEIQecmfyFAQxTJCNQK\nbiVpKiErUGDZw9uTf+7gY6YeRTMplF9p/qdYE2RmO5TLqBbKbEYQRyDvtcNirzxz\nKuJU3weJ0GDE0Pe0y0WTGdOGsvew43wtICMv4ZiC7moxiDStJ8Yp8nRkz9rvRZha\nwyKZcY7LZ4c5oYzlM01JtpYZdtGP8jFbr04Ae8OPapBIyOZOA8w