m/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/17958899ea1807c2728dec38dcb7aa7fa59f2659/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:14:35Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:14:35Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"Resolve the runtime page-schema name per request locale\n\nPlugin import writes the page display name into the tenant i18n bundle\nas page.<pageKey>.title (en-US + zh-CN), but the runtime read path\n/api/pages/key/{pageKey} served the stored single-locale schema.name, so\nEN sessions rendered the zh page title. Resolve the name through the\ni18n resource for the request locale (query param > X-Locale >\nAccept-Language, per I18nLocaleResolver) and keep the stored name when\nno record exists. Extraction into a static helper keeps the controller\nthin and unit-testable: 4 cases (override / absent record / blank value\n/ blank stored name).","tree":{"sha":"d25eb3c178a9f5e69e6b460dae0b49e150f46551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/d25eb3c178a9f5e69e6b460dae0b49e150f46551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/17958899ea1807c2728dec38dcb7aa7fa59f2659","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u