t":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:59:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Platform host seams for the commerce storefront composition (B16) (#2215)\n\n- aura.persistence.host-table-prefixes / host-mapper-packages: host-owned\n  table families and mapper packages skip the tenant-line and env-layer\n  interceptors before SQL parsing (both TenantLineInnerInterceptor instances\n  wrapped by HostScopeAwareTenantLineInterceptor).\n- FileServiceImpl: MultipartProperties optional for non-web hosts.\nVerified end-to-end: the runtime m2 jar built from these changes ran the\nfull commerce gate (431 UT green; real-stack gate green in isolated runs).\nNote: origin/main currently fails compileTestJava independently\n(ValidationServiceBatchRelationsTest vs ValidationServiceImpl constructor),\npre-dating this change.\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdb869fe0cd95aea07b60feb09bbd584738314f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/fdb869fe0cd95aea07b60feb09bbd584738314f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/4bee9788206f122a94ca1f7f1bb1466f63b523f1","verification":{"payload":"tree fdb869fe0cd95aea07b60feb09bbd584738314f4\nparent 3b0ed4be68765470999fb26224495369526315ac\nauthor vavi <ghjapple@163.com> 1791302377 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791302377 +0800\n\nPlatform host seams for the commerce storefront composition (B16) (#2215)\n\n- aura.persistence.host-table-prefixes / host-mapper-packages: host-owned\n  table families and mapper packages skip the tenant-line and env-layer\n  interceptors before SQL parsing (both TenantLineInnerInterceptor instances\n  wrapped by HostScopeAwareTenantLineInterceptor).\n- FileServiceImpl: MultipartProperties optional for non-web hosts.\nVerified end-to-end: the runtime m2 jar built from these changes ran the\nfull commerce gate (431 UT green; real-stack gate green in isolated runs).\nNote: ori