rl":"https://github.com/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commit/63aac35a9f337d048d3a92ad0e1ad7e0727bc892","sha":"63aac35a9f337d048d3a92ad0e1ad7e0727bc892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/63aac35a9f337d048d3a92ad0e1ad7e0727bc892"}],"sha":"a30782d7f99cb5c61bc115b94de4e5f9e8b3fbb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/a30782d7f99cb5c61bc115b94de4e5f9e8b3fbb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/63aac35a9f337d048d3a92ad0e1ad7e0727bc892/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:33:49Z","email":"ghjapple@163.com","name":"vavi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T03:33:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Make capability authorization explicit and keep atomic permissions diagnostic (#2157)\n\n* fix(permission): expose business capabilities and explicit scope states\n\n* fix(permission): keep role UI business-focused and extend draft regressions\n\n* fix(permission): ship editor translations and await persisted browser state\n\n* test(permission): bind capability interaction to hydrated stable identity\n\n* fix(permission): protect drafts from stale reads and block unverified snapshots\n\n* docs: record complete capability authorization implementation plan\n\n* feat: configure declared capabilities with explicit change previews and read-only diagnostics\n\n* fix: include platform API dependencies and verify explicit partial authorization flows\n\n* Fix member capability actions and verify permission transaction boundaries\n\n* fix: close capability dependencies and verify uploaded file readback\n\n* fix: verify capability-only roles and usable member assignment entry\n\n* Verify guarded customer deletion and record pending acceptance gates\n\n* Keep permission previews within the viewport and fix member checkbox selection\n\n* Enforce declared form authoring permissions and preserve record access denials\n\n* Verify attachment downloads preserve the quote page and file bytes\n\n* Localize permission diagnostics and restore self-contained CI dependencies\n\n* Keep RBAC validation from closing other runtime owners\n\n* test(permission): verify reader menus and cross-tenant quote denial\n\n* fix(menu): retain navigation directories for authorized children\n\n* fix(auth): scope model service configuration without shared cloud grants\n\n* fix(admin): retry saved configuration readback without duplicate writes\n\n* fix(permissions): align member bulk actions with member grants\n\n* fix(permissions): declare member command action guards\n\n* fix(permissions): scope member offboarding preflight by action\n\n* test(permissions): cover member preflight grants revocation and real scope\n\n* fix(permissions): expose separate member offboarding capabilities\n\n* test(permission): cover default scope transaction rollback\n\n* test(permission): align viewer menus and isolate screenshot artifacts\n\n* test(bom): cover rule reader navigation before authoring denial\n\n* test(permission): locate read-only rule detail fields correctly\n\n* fix(permission): summarize capability changes with expandable impacts\n\n* test(permission): bind chart responses and initialize foreign quote pages\n\n* fix(meta): return safe not-found responses for tenant-scoped records\n\n* fix(permission): handle missing file metadata and simplify capability rows\n\n* test(bom): verify category policies through admin and reader menus\n\n* test(bom): search paginated category definitions before opening details\n\n* Clarify partial action grants and capture policy sections in context\n\n* fix(permissions): include employee selector reads in member management\n\n* fix(permissions): avoid unproven organization model grants for member provisioning\n\n* refactor(permission): group partial impacts in grant previews\n\n* style(permission): format preview coverage assertions\n\n* Preserve unmapped visibility permissions in mixed matrices\n\n* Fold preview menus while preserving complete impact details\n\n* test(permission): verify profile readers and capture loaded shared quotes\n\n* fix(org): align department writes with organization capability\n\n* fix(permission): align employee writes and record scope summaries\n\n* test(permission): capture visible record scope summaries\n\n* test(org): enforce tenant boundaries for member employee linking\n\n* fix(org): reject foreign tenant members during employee linking\n\n* test(permission): assert loaded defaults and readable upload timestamps\n\n* test(rbac): verify independent member offboarding preflight actions\n\n* test(rbac): use canonical deactivate preflight action\n\n* test(rbac): expose native member detail read boundary bypass\n\n* test(rbac): isolate missing grants and cover native member teams\n\n* fix(rbac): enforce member read boundaries on native detail and teams\n\n* fix: authorize native member actions through shared commands\n\n* test: drive native member lifecycle through detail buttons\n\n* test: enter member lifecycle through menu and exact fixture row\n\n* fix: host native member command forms and localize member status\n\n* fix(tenant): preserve member targets until domain lifecycle checks\n\nDeclare Spring handler persistence ownership without changing authorization or state checks. Skip generic parent and cascade writes for domain-owned mutations. Add real-stack removal and self-protection regression cases, and set native offboarding dialog titles.\n\n* test(permissions): register native lifecycle in existing full gate\n\nKeep the lifecycle journey in its own golden spec so the existing role manifest can include it without collecting unrelated historical cases. Cover handler aliases and missing-handler refusal before generic deletion.\n\n* fix(web): distinguish safe member confirmations and await settled list capture\n\n* fix(web): localize member entries and wait for loaded member rows\n\n* Fix record sharing dialog clipping and localize missing record feedback\n\n* fix(permissions): distinguish native member denial and verify configured grants\n\n* fix(org): expose team read capability and correct membership removal\n\n* test(auth): wait for transient notifications before golden captures\n\n* fix(admin): keep member dates readable in the default list layout\n\n* fix(admin): retain room for complete member status labels\n\n* fix(org): declare team CRUD command authorization\n\n* fix(org): enforce team record read authorization on native APIs\n\n* test: preserve role grants when capability dependencies change\n\n* fix(permissions): guide member lifecycle inputs and assert localized states\n\n* Guard employee reads and scope account provisioning identities\n\n* Keep employee boundary fixture identities within username limits\n\n* Guard unlinked member identities with organization management permission\n\n* Bind employee account provisioning to employee row scope\n\n* Limit member search responses to collaborator identities\n\n* Show personnel relationship names and localized organization states\n\n* test(permissions): cover independent lifecycle and owner attachment access\n\n* fix(permissions): close scoped authorization gaps and retain local acceptance\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9db8dc95353934839a77ddb0d3716976ac6e8cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/9db8dc95353934839a77ddb0d3716976ac6e8cae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/63aac35a9f337d048d3a92ad0e1ad7e0727bc892","verification":{"payload":"tree 9db8dc95353934839a77ddb0d3716976ac6e8cae\nparent f591c0bbef3b28b4e52f6481a63d94d5d8992715\nauthor vavi <ghjapple@163.com> 1791257629 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791257629 +0800\n\nMake capability authorization explicit and keep atomic permissions diagnostic (#2157)\n\n* fix(permission): expose business capabilities and explicit scope states\n\n* fix(permission): keep role UI business-focused and extend draft regressions\n\n* fix(permission): ship editor translations and await persisted browser state\n\n* test(permission): bind capability interaction to hydrated stable identity\n\n* fix(permission): protect drafts from stale reads and block unverified snapshots\n\n* docs: record complete capability authorization implementation plan\n\n* feat: configure declared capabilities with explicit change previews and read-only diagnostics\n\n* fix: include platform API dependencies and verify explicit partial authorization flows\n\n* Fix member capability actions and verify permission transaction boundaries\n\n* fix: close capability dependencies and verify uploaded file readback\n\n* fix: verify capability-only roles and usable member assignment entry\n\n* Verify guarded customer deletion and record pending acceptance gates\n\n* Keep permission previews within the viewport and fix member checkbox selection\n\n* Enforce declared form authoring permissions and preserve record access denials\n\n* Verify attachment downloads preserve the quote page and 