omplete impact details\n\n* test(permission): verify profile readers and capture loaded shared quotes\n\n* fix(org): align department writes with organization capability\n\n* fix(permission): align employee writes and record scope summaries\n\n* test(permission): capture visible record scope summaries\n\n* test(org): enforce tenant boundaries for member employee linking\n\n* fix(org): reject foreign tenant members during employee linking\n\n* test(permission): assert loaded defaults and readable upload timestamps\n\n* test(rbac): verify independent member offboarding preflight actions\n\n* test(rbac): use canonical deactivate preflight action\n\n* test(rbac): expose native member detail read boundary bypass\n\n* test(rbac): isolate missing grants and cover native member teams\n\n* fix(rbac): enforce member read boundaries on native detail and teams\n\n* fix: authorize native member actions through shared commands\n\n* test: drive native member lifecycle through detail buttons\n\n* test: enter member lifecycle through menu and exact fixture row\n\n* fix: host native member command forms and localize member status\n\n* fix(tenant): preserve member targets until domain lifecycle checks\n\nDeclare Spring handler persistence ownership without changing authorization or state checks. Skip generic parent and cascade writes for domain-owned mutations. Add real-stack removal and self-protection regression cases, and set native offboarding dialog titles.\n\n* test(permissions): register native lifecycle in existing full gate\n\nKeep the lifecycle journey in its own golden spec so the existing role manifest can include it without collecting unrelated historical cases. Cover handler aliases and missing-handler refusal before generic deletion.\n\n* fix(web): distinguish safe member confirmations and await settled list capture\n\n* fix(web): localize member entries and wait for loaded member rows\n\n* Fix record sharing dialog clipping and localize missing record feedback\n\n* fix(permissions): distinguish native member denial and verify configured grants\n\n* fix(org): expose team read capability and correct membership removal\n\n* test(auth): wait for transient notifications before golden captures\n\n* fix(admin): keep member dates readable in the default list layout\n\n* fix(admin): retain room for complete member status labels\n\n* fix(org): declare team CRUD command authorization\n\n* fix(org): enforce team record read authorization on native APIs\n\n* test: preserve role grants when capability dependencies change\n\n* fix(permissions): guide member lifecycle inputs and assert localized states\n\n* Guard employee reads and scope account provisioning identities\n\n* Keep employee boundary fixture identities within username limits\n\n* Guard unlinked member identities with organization management permission\n\n* Bind employee account provisioning to employee row scope\n\n* Limit member search responses to collaborator identities\n\n* Show personnel relationship names and localized organization states\n\n* test(permissions): cover independent lifecycle and owner attachment access\n\n* fix(permissions): close scoped authorization gaps and retain local acceptance\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diqi <216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxGwdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJbEQAAwjLr7cUTxkKOk7zNIVK0zt\nt3sDHR5y2RiPch/r72Gc+Ok0nGAuxpYHgrWePc2Z+oj4BSYbxW6fItZGjzj8Mi5G\nln5eVO+rf98XhsPq5Pkj8L6eTm96CSD5XxkxzM0TZsWOiKn9O9PD9ZaZCs5p5nr0\n+FICsej1yvwP0UVLk/YQVtpNxfXeXkjRYPS7S85rb9s7qgG7Q8EhYPtwq7DK8mgl\nmHYU4gImflzrjeyFldIJf+atNgQEClgbjCr2tz4RRzUO6V4o+hxoo8L6qzCVxKeB\noy/flGAS+NBsBqd3tN7ekAHsfGF/QNcI+4eDTL9CbyVjDRkMwhXP5OFfGqgm9v3M\nUpYdrdeHKVTNrlwdEHb0RPiZnTELD797uKUMWQA0tQC+DTS6GhZU2J+suWSRnSR6\nEeDDwShU+eKfoVN/jwVKMUj1Qo9KkDaAKrI4TPgmE/yRTVa1qbwXZC/a4Cop0f1R\nDKhcOmU+sFwc+ZdfDPTcAEnYXzP1H2yPJDLEinn7P+YwHMgw5ffYDMAHtX9hzV2J\nev1ona0mMhWW3UYpOKxNqZAfbegELV29mZpi+9uuA4sBzFlUAv4MgWvM9uw