th plumbing + legacy-column reverse lookup + copy-style migration with per-package receipts), branch reconciled with main (three untouched-by-T5A files taken from main''s side). Verified on an isolated slot-22 stack: 12/12 assertions, idempotent re-import, old/new switchover.","tree":{"sha":"f5244cb704f1b2e5ca87ea277754884413ac22b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/f5244cb704f1b2e5ca87ea277754884413ac22b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/7f8dd4f539093ae299ba036e8677199dc7b45480","verification":{"payload":"tree f5244cb704f1b2e5ca87ea277754884413ac22b8\nparent d04de5afb1f0ae595aa793c68eb9572e321a9b48\nauthor vavi <ghjapple@163.com> 1791208738 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791208738 +0800\n\nfeat(plugins): identifier migration contract for the customer-pcba rename upgrade (#2216)\n\nT5-A: the #611 rename shipped an identifier map no runtime consumer — installs carrying jiejia-* identities had no upgrade path. Implements the minimal contract (identifierMappingPath plumbing + legacy-column reverse lookup + copy-style migration with per-package receipts), branch reconciled with main (three untouched-by-T5A files taken from main''s side). Verified on an isolated slot-22 stack: 12/12 assertions, idempotent re-import, old/new switchover.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw60iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABMUQAH4z4PKVBJb9OIx7X/Jtznn8\neEayDNJubatupzuUDMps1KaAIxq885vbRTkZRRz4sxI79Nb7AnQLuyQK9fbVhZMG\nTtCvBYUG8mePNdYe5mzbgQZNN2tcGQnxFTicbYGTS7PcGvafcMt6tHuU8/mCyR44\n0u4NrHFFH5/sr+afwNz7w+Zyk2BZ5j2EUMDCx53YaVJHwW8MdVvFaFidKAUzeMf9\nF4tdYJre105k6xFvz8jJCZ5+34PS1FVAmMObhHCDytFBm+TqK9dc8roU8cM1/eri\neEb/5kWu4fdZv2qhKrf8nSoO/Ij27TFbch2OvH/YhOKI4/+wvMl2M4PCGHHZtVQ4\n8dxjJMpQp79m7lmTKuB64bL594x/6gIPfAYcAsmcx9nHIvGaePFWtuA/clIUPhtV\nCv6Xk9kLTdBy1TRFJ78pOqPHssS30nOAMH3WyO4/AHqUMZZNvky4seVZMBVPToSp\nps2ppal2uhCtPBrDr3tMtZ76fhZtUoA5jl51+flsiUgIwNlSOuufRWbnngwentZZ\ndoP