avi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/2cb27482bba63d538b87b48d8aa382383a01859a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:07:39Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:07:39Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"Reset the dashboard store by mutating the draft, not replacing it\n\nBisecting the DHIFI-01 instability isolated one hunk: reset() returning a\nreplacement object from the immer recipe diverges from set(initialState)\nunder the immer+zustand(set) interaction and reliably broke the first\npalette add inside the test runner, while the same actions passed outside\nit. Assign initialState onto the draft and keep the mutation generation\nmoving forward instead. Unit evidence for the load-clobber guard stands\n(48/48); interactive E2E re-verification stays inconclusive while this host\nruns at load 20-30 with ten concurrent sessions and is deferred to a quiet\nwindow or the nightly CI host.","tree":{"sha":"cfd1ddab7f10fc5f7cdc32aaffd0c9688d68f48a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/cfd1ddab7f10fc5f7cdc32aaffd0c9688d68f48a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/2cb27482bba63d538b87b48d8aa382383a01859a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"ht