min":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/aa0c0e73129e478da078876546a3d9e82512234a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:01:52Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:01:52Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"P3 polish batch: workbench stats height, toolbar measure, attachment i18n, list title locale\n\n- WorkbenchTemplateProvider: stats row h 1→2; rowHeight 80 gave the\n  stats-card frame 80px against a 128px min-height card, clipping the\n  card bottoms on every fresh workbench.\n- FileAttachmentField: ''+ Add file''/''Uploading...'' localized through a\n  co-located i18n json (was hardcoded English on zh pages).\n- ListPageContent: page title falls through getLocalizedText so a\n  LocalizedText schema.name renders per locale (backend page-schema name\n  is currently a plain zh string — backend resolution recorded\n  separately).\n- Column header truncation in the showcase list dismissed: the 评分\n  column sits at the horizontal scroll boundary next to a sticky-right\n  actions column; standard frozen-column behavior, not a rendering\n  defect. Designer toolbar title/undo adjacency measured on-device: no\n  bounding-box overlap at 1280 or 1440; editable input self-clips.","tree":{"sha":"70a26947e420a4e00f76f6cd9d133ef14902a54b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/70a26947e420a4e00f76f6cd9d133ef14902a54b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/aa0c0e73129e478da078876546a3d9e82512234a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_u