/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/07e0587cf03c28db4faa82ac1c490f2701766262/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:28:35Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:28:35Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"Do not let dashboard loads clobber unsaved local widget edits\n\nDHIFI-01 failed intermittently with two signatures — a palette add that\nseemed to do nothing, and a just-added widget detaching mid-click. Both are\nthe same race: a dashboard load fetch that was still on the wire while the\nauthor added the widget lands afterwards and replaces the whole widgets\narray with the older server state, visibly deleting the new widget. The\nstore now counts content mutations and refuses to apply a load response\nwhose fetch started before the latest mutation (or that targets a dashboard\nthe designer has already left), dedupes concurrent loads per pid, and moves\nthe reset generation forward monotonically so a discarded dashboard''s\nin-flight response cannot resurrect it. The seed hook uses the playwright\n1.60 way to extend its budget (test.setTimeout inside the hook — there is\nno beforeAll(fn, timeout) overload).","tree":{"sha":"7aeb74096cdc6cec3b703aa0ec8f4370d1e1c3b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/7aeb7409