t/commits/96e5f38dfb5ec075e870b19953627fd06d3b6189/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:12Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:12Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"Grant module-scoped model permissions to sc_admin; validate field references at runtime\n\nTwo owner-approved governance decisions from the SWOT launch round:\n\nsc_admin could execute showcase commands but every page-data query 403''d\nbecause model.*.read grants only exist on tenant_admin — a module\nadministrator that cannot see the module. Grant model-scoped\nread/create/update for showcase_all_fields and sc_monthly_metric in the\nplugin''s role declaration.\n\nPlain reference fields (extension.referenceModel) bypassed the relation\nexistence check, so a command accepted a dangling pid and persisted an\nunjoinable row behind a success envelope. Field-level references now run\nthe same tenant-scoped existence check model relations already had:\nrefTarget.targetTable wins, else the referenced model''s registered table;\nsys_user stays on the tenant-member handler; a missing referenced model\ndegrades to a warning like the relation validator. Multi-value JSON\narrays validate each element.\n\nUnit coverage (7 cases) plus a real-PostgreSQL CoverageIT (existing pid\npasses, dangling rejected, cross-tenant pid rejected). Existing\nValidationService tests updated for the added constructor dependency.","tree":{"sha":"577239127e70606323eae19e1d8244d5254551f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/577239127e70606323eae19e1d8244d5254551f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/96e5f38dfb5ec075e870b19953627fd06d3b6189","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_ur