es and G-series\nscenes through the e2et_crm_opp_list Browse-All entry, a stage-rail detail, a\nselect-capable form and a four-view list surface, but the fixture plugin only\never declared the bare model/fields/dict and commands - the page and menu\ndeclarations the 10-02 golden run relied on were never committed, so every\nopportunity scene failed with ''fixture menu item missing'' against any frozen\nsource set. Author them from the established in-plugin DSL shapes: a list page\nwith dict stage chips plus the multi-view extension (table/kanban/calendar/\ngallery), a detail page carrying the verbatim CRM pipeline stage-rail block,\nand a create/edit form with required name/stage; menu e2et_crm_opp_list joins\nits sibling lists at the top level.","tree":{"sha":"47a991347c62a022d66225edeb0ec79d2d77d1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/47a991347c62a022d66225edeb0ec79d2d77d1f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/b2a159810f158412f562dba6f2acb5f8898cbf88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/us