,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:57:32Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"Fall through to label defaults when i18n keys are missing\n\nThe legacy $i18n: branches in resolveFieldPlaceholder, resolveFieldLabel,\nresolveColumnLabel and the button-content resolver returned t(key)\nverbatim, so imported page DSL keys absent from the served dictionary\nleaked raw identifiers into the UI (the showcase team-members picker\nrendered $i18n:model.showcase_all_fields.sc_team_members.placeholder on\nits empty-state button). Apply the same missing-key fall-through the\nmodel-key paths already use: return the translation only when it differs\nfrom the key, otherwise continue to the label-based defaults. Vitest\n11/11 including new raw-key regression cases.","tree":{"sha":"63ff7b7728118215fd6a114a9e57c42b6282de37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/63ff7b7728118215fd6a114a9e57c42b6282de37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/962895450f467fab8acafba338e9e4cc8149cd4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":