647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/commits/192cbaa1b1b24f20b87bc3acd19955fd3628dbe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:16:18Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:16:18Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"test(schema): pin core migration version floor against backdated numbering\n\nThe 2026-10-05 incident: an org migration was backdated to V20261003010000,\nbelow versions that preserved databases had already recorded, which made\nevery such database permanently unmigratable under the strict governance\nflags (outOfOrder=false with retired overrides). The emergency fix renamed\nit to V20261005110000.\n\nThis floor record and test make that class of defect fail the build: the\nhighest migration version and the exact file count are pinned, so any new\nmigration PR must consciously raise both together. Verified red against a\nsimulated backdated file and green on the current tree; flyway-known-drift\nand snapshot-schema-contract suites stay green.","tree":{"sha":"66c508d7687f50e90baab525c9f54c6b53b68bb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/66c508d7687f50e90baab525c9f54c6b53b68bb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/192cbaa1b1b24f20b87bc3acd19955fd3628dbe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"c