{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:15:37Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:15:37Z","email":"216647+vavi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"diqi"},"message":"fix(designer): serializer passthrough preserves legacy top-level block keys\n\nserializePassthrough emitted only id/blockType/region/title/dataSource/\nlayout/props/blocks — every legacy top-level key (metric-strip variant/\nmetrics, description content, embedded-list modelCode, status-banner\nstatusField/toneMap, workbench-action-bar actions/surface/align, …) was\nsilently dropped on the first save. The passthrough contract is verbatim:\nunmanaged top-level keys now survive the round trip (props still wins for\neditor-materialized keys). This is the payload-builder fix behind the\nbinding-loss family — the skipped legacy-authoring cases unblock once this\nships. Serializer unit tests 19/19.","tree":{"sha":"f5d8489394e979328ba6677f94414d11a5c740b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/trees/f5d8489394e979328ba6677f94414d11a5c740b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AuraBootTeam/auraboot/git/commits/52136fbbb92b9997ee8a16720225d6d82f0d4f4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vavi","id":216647,"login":"vavi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjY0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vavi/repos","site_admin":false,"starre