m/u/35952395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TaewonyNet","id":35952395,"login":"TaewonyNet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTUyMzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/commits/1c5a5c12d59d7d6a35d325831a33be4749e2948c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T13:35:24Z","email":"twkang@tidesquare.com","name":"강태원"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T13:35:24Z","email":"twkang@tidesquare.com","name":"강태원"},"message":"feat(quota,model): 무료 모델 자동선택 + 쿼터 모니터링 + 실측 probe + CLI 대시보드\n\nLLMLingua 압축 폴백, Gemini 무료 모델 자동 탐색·교체, 키 쿼터 모니터링(자체\n카운트 + 실측 probe), 그리고 웹 대시보드 기능을 담은 CLI 를 추가한다.\n\n압축(compressor):\n- LLMLingua-2 모델 로딩 폴백 체인(selective-substitution → meetingbank → 단순추출).\n  기존 단일 모델이 HF 401 이라 조용히 단순추출로 빠지던 문제 해소.\n\n모델 자동선택(gemini/gateway/analyzer):\n- GeminiAdapter.find_working_model — 우선순위 후보를 경량 probe 해 403/404 스킵,\n  200/429(권한 OK) 채택, 첫 성공 중단(쿼터 최소).\n- startup discovery 직후 DEFAULT_FREE_MODEL 이 사용 불가(403)면 자동 교체.\n  예: gemini-flash-latest(403) → gemini-2.5-flash.\n\n쿼터 모니터링(key_manager/config/gateway):\n- 키별 분/일(PT) 요청 카운터(버킷 경계 자동 리셋) + 429 메타(retryDelay/quotaId).\n- get_status 의 key_statistics 에 quota 뷰(사용량·한도·리셋·쿨다운·플래그) 노출.\n- config: quota_rpm_free/quota_rpd_free 한도(문서 기반, .env 조정).\n\n실측 probe — 외부 사용 반영(gateway/endpoints):\n- probe_active_keys: 활성 키를 실제 호출 probe 해 외부 사용 포함 가용성 갱신.\n  자체 카운트(내부분만)의 한계 보완. 429→쿨다운, 성공→last_probe.\n- POST /v1/admin/probe?active=true 로 on-demand 트리거.\n\nCLI 종합 대시보드(scripts/quota_cli.py):\n- 웹 대시보드 전 기능: dashboard(통계·제공자별·키헬스/쿼터·오류·스크래핑),\n  quota, sessions, logs, settings(민감값 마스킹).\n- --watch(주기 갱신), --probe(활성 키 실측). 표준 라이브러리만.\n\nUI: admin.html 키 상태에 쿼터 패널(진행바·일일/분당 사용량·리셋·쿨다운·403/429).\n테스트: model-autoselect 4 + key-quota 3 추가. 전체 192 passed, ruff clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02db54efff4df82ece0f901553a02ce5514191a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/git/trees/02db54efff4df82ece0f901553a02ce5514191a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/git/commits/1c5a5c12d59d7d6a35d325831a33be4749e2948c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35952395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TaewonyNet","id":35952395,"login":"TaewonyNet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTUyMzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/commit/1c5a5c12d59d7d6a35d325831a33be4749e2948c","node_id":"C_kwDORxKxTdoAKDFjNWE1YzEyZDU5ZDdkNmEzNWQzMjU4MzFhMzNiZTQ3NDllMjk0OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/commit/107eb67dcef4b7c664c7019166da7a5432531c9b","sha":"107eb67dcef4b7c664c7019166da7a5432531c9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/commits/107eb67dcef4b7c664c7019166da7a5432531c9b"}],"sha":"1c5a5c12d59d7d6a35d325831a33be4749e2948c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/commits/1c5a5c12d59d7d6a35d325831a33be4749e2948c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35952395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TaewonyNet","id":35952395,"login":"TaewonyNet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTUyMzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/commits/107eb67dcef4b7c664c7019166da7a5432531c9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:41:14Z","email":"twkang@tidesquare.com","name":"강태원"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:41:14Z","email":"twkang@tidesquare.com","name":"강태원"},"message":"hardening: 리질리언스·라우팅·보안·세션 정합성 전면 강화 (1.3.0)\n\norigin/main 이후 누적 작업을 단일 커밋으로 정리. 동작/문서/테스트 일괄 반영.\n\n리질리언스·동시성:\n- ResilienceManager/AgentExecutor/WebEnrichmentCoordinator/SessionOrchestrator/\n  MemoryOptimizer 추출 — Gateway 는 얇은 오케스트레이터로 유지.\n- CircuitBreaker half-open 단일 프로브 게이팅, KeyManager 쿨다운 존중(quota 1h/\n  403 24h/기타 단기) + 풀 락, 60s 재프로브가 cooldown_until 경과 키만 대상.\n- ContextManager 요청 격리(task-keyed), 블로킹 IO asyncio.to_thread 이관,\n  local_cli subprocess 타임아웃/kill, gemini 동기 호출 to_thread.\n\n라우팅:\n- 구조 결함 S1 해소 — strict 판정을 decision.strict 로 단일화(analyzer 가 원본\n  힌트로 결정, resilience 가 소비). 토큰 임계값 MAX_TOKENS_FAST_MODEL=8192 일원화.\n- Gemini 쏠림 완화 — 웹 의도가 provider 를 강제하지 않도록 de-funnel, fast tier\n  Groq↔Cerebras 라운드로빈, trafilatura markdown 추출로 컨텍스트 토큰 절감.\n- 멀티모달/provider-scoped auto 정합성, 키 부재 시 graceful 로컬 저하.\n\n보안:\n- admin fail-closed(미설정+비debug→503) + X-Admin-Key 검증, SSRF 리다이렉트 재검증.\n- 프론트 SPA 최소 보안 — XSS 이스케이프(esc) + 관리자 인증 헤더(adminFetch).\n\n세션·데이터:\n- MemoryOptimizer 단일 트랜잭션 compaction, 요약 입력 dedup, fork point 검증,\n  멀티모달 토큰 추정 정합. metrics 인메모리 dead 카운터 제거(SQLite 단일 진실원).\n\n문서·테스트:\n- SPEC 11절 전면 개편, README/IMPROVEMENTS/DEPLOYMENT 현행화, 웹 로그 포맷 정정.\n- 회귀 가드 다수 추가, 가짜 통합테스트를 라이브 스크립트로 이전. tests/ 185 passed,\n  ruff clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"85b6b600830411f669b1a52a94c2f6464ff2232b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/git/trees/85b6b600830411f669b1a52a94c2f6464ff2232b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TaewonyNet/HydraLLM/git/commits/107eb67dcef4b7c664c7019166da7a5432531c9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35952395?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TaewonyNet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://