support and taskbar progress reporting (main.js): base64 icons, updateThumbarButtons, updateTaskbarProgress, and ipc handler for media state. Wire renderer to send playback state from App.tsx via ipc when isPlaying/hasActiveSong/currentTime/duration change. Improve in-app controls: MiniPlayer gets an animated volume popover with pointer drag/capture and hover behavior; PlayerControls now supports pointer-based dragging for progress and volume with smoother transitions and touch-friendly behavior. Bump app version to 0.1.2 in package.json (and lockfile).","tree":{"sha":"1688ad1ebee7149e1ecac6e5b229ef17b15d2ef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LingYuWings/Radiflow-Player/git/trees/1688ad1ebee7149e1ecac6e5b229ef17b15d2ef9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LingYuWings/Radiflow-Player/git/commits/b7a7e9c636a96e82f31a89559bda3c47588359c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32763318?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LingYuWings","id":32763318,"login":"LingYuWings","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzYzMzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LingYuWings","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LingYuWings/Radiflow-Player/