https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nelcp/Openedx_guide/commits/24aba4d0d62d86e9c37eb8b44788fd0ab6434a55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T14:21:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T14:21:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: Initial implementation of Open edX Training Guide MFE\n\nA role-based training application (Learner, Trainer, Admin) that combines\ncurated static content from Open edX docs with an AI assistant (Claude API).\n\nComponents:\n- React MFE with @edx/frontend-platform and Paragon design system\n- Django backend plugin with REST API and Claude AI proxy\n- 18 training modules covering all three roles\n- Tutor plugin for Open edX deployment and LMS integration\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01G4CWEYrCu1qH83J93Vo5FK","tree":{"sha":"a7c824c958ae4a2a04f604bcb2acc7d18227bc6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nelcp/Openedx_guide/git/trees/a7c824c958ae4a2a04f604bcb2acc7d18227bc6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nelcp/Openedx_guide/git/commits/24aba4d0d62d86e9c37eb8b44788fd0ab6434a55","verification":{"payload":"tree a7c824c958ae4a2a04f604bcb2acc7d18227bc6f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774534900 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774534900 +0000\n\nfeat: Initial implementation of Open edX Training Guide MFE\n\nA role-based training application (Learner, Trainer, Admin) that combines\ncurated static content from Open edX docs with an AI assistant (Claude API).\n\nComponents:\n- React MFE with @edx/frontend-platform and Paragon design system\n- Django backend plugin with REST API and Claude AI proxy\n- 18 training modules covering all three roles\n- Tutor plugin for Open edX deployment and LMS integration\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01G4CWEYrCu1qH83J93Vo5FK\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPLy5Jyc\nQpLdbxS2h5UWIQF9h7a4UxIke1NlA8TO/NadFmX/mGC+Rh7fTdB7DE5OEWZORUB5XDaP3m6imexB\n+AI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-26T14:21:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nelcp/Openedx_guide/commit/24aba4d0d62d86e9c37eb8b44788fd0ab6434a55","node_id":"C_kwDORxd8SNoAKDI0YWJhNGQwZDYyZDg2ZTljMzdlYjhiNDQ3ODhmZDBhYjY0MzRhNTU","parents":[],"sha":"24aba4d0d62d86e9c37eb8b44788fd0ab6434a55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nelcp/Openedx_guide/commits/24aba4d0d62d86e9c37eb8b44788fd0ab6434a55"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nelcp/Openedx_guide/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=7a812b20f81015f46a6f7dd3a99cef6291f